{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PEmNnkHQi1mEcv93mAqFCf","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (195KB). Full output saved to: /Users/kalethabh/.claude/projects/-Users-kalethabh-Anuncios-con-IA/f17f1593-2f67-4602-83cb-0d79fa14ee5c/tool-results/toolu_01PEmNnkHQi1mEcv93mAqFCf.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\n{\"requestId\":\"a0cb805e-c0d5-44f4-a7ec-452938f11383\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1004510505650684\",\"collationId\":\"1361008499424725\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-17T02:24:45.096Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-06-16T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-06-16T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":0,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/a6ff526f4a69d7e017b8b53647f97fc717fb39c840b072f0b611dfd846d2e960.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/53e5783c43d8c3e76cb496492d0c3f2c750287ddf0fe7bf2777a059c786e2aa6.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1092642590588295\",\"name\":\"Dr. Sarah Jensen - Metabolic Innovation\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1092642590588295.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1092642590588295\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":24407,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":1965,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"At 58, Even As A Retired Nurse, I Had To Learn To Listen To My Body\\n\\nFor years, I worked in patient care.\\n\\nI spent my life helping other people understand their bodies, their routines, and the changes that come with age.\\n\\nSo when my own body started changing after 50, I thought I knew exactly what to do.\\n\\nEat cleaner.\\nMove more.\\nStay disciplined.\\nPush harder.\\n\\nBut this time, it felt different.\\n\\nMy clothes felt tighter around the middle.\\nI felt heavier after meals.\\nMy energy didn’t last like it used to.\\nAnd some mornings, I woke up still feeling weighed down.\\n\\nThe frustrating part?\\n\\nMy habits hadn’t really changed.\\n\\nThat was the moment I realized something I had told other women for years:\\n\\nYour body is not something to fight.\\n\\nIt is something to understand.\\n\\nAfter years in nursing, I knew that the body changes with time. Digestion, energy, recovery, and daily rhythm can all feel different as we get older.\\n\\nSo I stopped looking for another extreme routine.\\n\\nAnd I started looking for something simple I could actu\n...\n</persisted-output>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f17f1593-2f67-4602-83cb-0d79fa14ee5c","uuid":"20526c42-2b6b-449d-ba30-f5a0ec0185a4","timestamp":"2026-11-27T18:48:45.290Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"requestId\":\"a0cb805e-c0d5-44f4-a7ec-452938f11383\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1004510505650684\",\"collationId\":\"1361008499424725\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-17T02:24:45.096Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-06-16T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-06-16T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":0,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/a6ff526f4a69d7e017b8b53647f97fc717fb39c840b072f0b611dfd846d2e960.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/53e5783c43d8c3e76cb496492d0c3f2c750287ddf0fe7bf2777a059c786e2aa6.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1092642590588295\",\"name\":\"Dr. Sarah Jensen - Metabolic Innovation\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1092642590588295.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1092642590588295\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":24407,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":1965,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"At 58, Even As A Retired Nurse, I Had To Learn To Listen To My Body\\n\\nFor years, I worked in patient care.\\n\\nI spent my life helping other people understand their bodies, their routines, and the changes that come with age.\\n\\nSo when my own body started changing after 50, I thought I knew exactly what to do.\\n\\nEat cleaner.\\nMove more.\\nStay disciplined.\\nPush harder.\\n\\nBut this time, it felt different.\\n\\nMy clothes felt tighter around the middle.\\nI felt heavier after meals.\\nMy energy didn’t last like it used to.\\nAnd some mornings, I woke up still feeling weighed down.\\n\\nThe frustrating part?\\n\\nMy habits hadn’t really changed.\\n\\nThat was the moment I realized something I had told other women for years:\\n\\nYour body is not something to fight.\\n\\nIt is something to understand.\\n\\nAfter years in nursing, I knew that the body changes with time. Digestion, energy, recovery, and daily rhythm can all feel different as we get older.\\n\\nSo I stopped looking for another extreme routine.\\n\\nAnd I started looking for something simple I could actually stay consistent with.\\n\\nThat’s when I found Velmorv® Nightly Balance Patches.\\n\\nA simple overnight belly button patch designed to support digestive comfort, bloating comfort, steady energy, metabolic rhythm, and daily balance while you rest.\\n\\nNo pills.\\nNo powders.\\nNo complicated routine.\\n\\nJust one patch before bed.\\n\\nThe formula features botanical ingredients like Ginger Root, Ceylon Cinnamon, Bitter Melon, Mugwort, Peppermint, Fennel, and Chromium.\\n\\nAs a retired nurse, I liked that it didn’t feel harsh or extreme.\\n\\nIt felt simple.\\n\\nAfter showering at night, I applied one patch to my belly button area.\\n\\nThen I went to sleep.\\n\\nThat was it.\\n\\nOver the next few weeks, I started noticing small changes.\\n\\nMy mornings felt lighter.\\nMy midsection felt less heavy.\\nMy digestion felt more settled.\\nAnd I felt more in rhythm with my body again.\\n\\nThis wasn’t about trying to become younger.\\n\\nIt was about feeling more comfortable in my body now.\\n\\nMore balanced.\\nMore steady.\\nMore like myself.\\n\\nIf you’re over 40 and your body doesn’t respond the way it used to…\\n\\nIf you feel heavy, bloated, or out of rhythm…\\n\\nYou may not need another strict routine.\\n\\nYou may just need a simple nightly ritual your body can follow.\\n\\nSonvyra® Nightly Balance Patches\\n\\nOne patch.\\nOne night.\\nA lighter-feeling morning.\\n\\nStart your new nightly ritual tonight.\\n\\n50% OFF today.\",\"transcript\":\"it seems to be working well for you yeah it really has I'm so happy with the results\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://www.sonvyra.com/products/belly-patch\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"sonvyra.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Start your new nightly ritual tonight.  50% OFF today\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":161,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_896295246121183\",\"collationId\":\"1228851462573511\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T08:47:31.571Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-01-18T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-04-12T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":84,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/da60e71cebed01f227d032992ae3637d0f3b87ce0c661432f695d318111fcb0a.jpg\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"795017747258532\",\"name\":\"The Primal Remedies\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/795017747258532.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"795017747258532\",\"liveAdsCount\":11,\"reach30d\":19,\"totalReach\":833453,\"countriesCount\":3,\"facebookLikes\":1013,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Looking for a natural way to support healthy blood sugar?\\nMost people don’t know there’s a huge difference between regular cin