rum lymphatic drainage herbs working together. Pure, potent, and concentrated liquid drops that absorb in 15 minutes.\\n\\n \\n\\nHalf a dropper morning and night for 60 days. You will see results. Third-party tested. Clinical strength doses. 30-day money-back guarantee.\\n\\n \\n\\nRight now, 3 bottles for $20. Prices are going up soon, and this sale ends tonight.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://ly.muvost.com/\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"ly.muvost.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"AT2A Lymphatic Drainage Drops\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"A gentle, plant-based daily ritual for lymphatic wellness.\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":2027,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":18,\"duplicates\":48,\"reachDelta1d\":8,\"reachDelta7d\":236,\"reachDelta30d\":1937},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AG\",\"AI\",\"AL\",\"AQ\",\"AS\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"AW\",\"AZ\",\"BA\",\"BB\",\"BE\",\"BG\",\"BH\",\"BL\",\"BM\",\"BN\",\"BO\",\"BS\",\"BZ\",\"CA\",\"CC\",\"CG\",\"CK\",\"CL\",\"CO\",\"CW\",\"CY\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"DM\",\"DO\",\"EC\",\"EE\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FJ\",\"FK\",\"FM\",\"FO\",\"GB\",\"GD\",\"GF\",\"GG\",\"GI\",\"GL\",\"GP\",\"GR\",\"GU\",\"GY\",\"HU\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IT\",\"JE\",\"JM\",\"JO\",\"KI\",\"KN\",\"KR\",\"KW\",\"KY\",\"LA\",\"LC\",\"LT\",\"LV\",\"MD\",\"MF\",\"MH\",\"MK\",\"MO\",\"MP\",\"MQ\",\"MS\",\"MX\",\"MY\",\"NC\",\"NF\",\"NO\",\"NR\",\"NU\",\"NZ\",\"OM\",\"PE\",\"PF\",\"PL\",\"PM\",\"PR\",\"PS\",\"PT\",\"PW\",\"PY\",\"RE\",\"RS\",\"SA\",\"SB\",\"SE\",\"SH\",\"SI\",\"SK\",\"SR\",\"SV\",\"SX\",\"TC\",\"TK\",\"TM\",\"TO\",\"TR\",\"TT\",\"TV\",\"US\",\"UY\",\"VC\",\"VG\",\"VI\",\"VU\",\"WF\",\"WS\",\"YT\"],\"mainCountry\":\"CY\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":57,\"currentRank\":57,\"rankDelta\":420,\"improvementPct\":1.66},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":true}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1084186990920386\",\"collation