dy sent the answer. You're the one refusing to reach for it. Now I'm gonna spit in the face of big pharma and expose the three biggest lies they tell you about type two diabetes. By the end, you'll know how to address the real problem once and for all. Give me sixty seconds to explain. Lie number one. Type two diabetes is caused by eating too much sugar or getting old. That's outdated. Type two diabetes is actually a cellular door disease. The doors on your cells stopped opening. Insulin knocks, but nothing answers. So every gram of sugar from every meal stays trapped in your bloodstream with nowhere to go. That trapped sugar grinds through the lining of every blood vessel in your body, after day, year after year, destroying your feet, your kidneys, your eyes, and your heart. That's why cutting carbs, fasting, or walking for hours does almost nothing. The doors are still closed. The sugar is still trapped. The grinding never stops. Lie number two, metformin or Ozempic fixes the problem. That's ridiculous. Metformin tells your liver to make less sugar. It never opens the doors. Ozempic slows your stomach, so less sugar enters your blood. It never opens the doors. Yardiance forces sugar out through your kidneys and wears them down while it does it. None of them touch the trapped sugar that's already grinding through your vessels right now. It's like turning down the faucet while the drain is clogged. The water stays. Lie number three. Type two diabetes is irreversible, and you'll be managing it until the day you die. It's criminal that they keep telling you this. Research has identified two compounds from true Ceylon cinnamon that address both halves. The first is called MHCP. It signals the doors on your cells to start opening again. And once those doors open, the trapped sugar finally moves out of your blood and into your cells where it gets burned for energy, the grinding stops. The second is called cinnamaldehyde. It repairs the vessel lining the trapped sugar has been destroying for years. It helps your vessels produce nitric oxide again, the signal that tells them to relax and carry blood back to the places it stopped reaching. Your feet, your kidneys, your eyes, your heart, two compounds, two jobs from one bark. And the best part, you take one soft gel every morning with breakfast, and that's it. Thousands of women are already using this to finally feel their feet again. They wake up with energy they haven't had in years. They sleep through the night. They check their fasting glucose and stare at the number because they don't believe it. Their doctors ask what changed, stunned, because their lab panels look different for the first time in a decade. But as you can imagine, big pharma making billions off diabetics like you is furious about it right now. They'd rather keep you on monthly prescriptions for the rest of your life than let you take one soft gel that costs less than a dollar a day. That's why I'm leaving the link below to Metabolay, the only product that gets all three variables right. DNA verified true Ceylon cinnamon from Sri Lanka. Not cassia from China, like 90% of what's on shelves. Concentrated 12 to one to match the clinical research dose, seven thousand two hundred milligram equivalent per soft gel. And suspended in MCT oil so the fat soluble compounds actually cross your gut wall and reach your bloodstream instead of passing straight through you like every dry capsule on Amazon. It comes with a full ninety day money back guarantee. So you can start doing this at home today. No prescription your doctor has ever written offered you a refund. Every batch is third party tested before it reaches you, which is why it works while the cheap cinnamon on Amazon does nothing for your blood sugar and quietly poisons your liver with coumarin while it does nothing. Tap the link below right now. And if the sale is live, consider yourself blessed. They make small batches. When it sells out, it takes time to source. True Ceylon from Sri Lanka at this concentration cannot be rushed. Two compounds, two jobs, one soft gel. That's the answer. Don't waste this chance.","callToAction":"LEARN MORE","landingPageUrl":"https://metabolae.com/products/softgels-ceylon-standard","landingPageDomain":"metabolae.com","ctaDescription":"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil","ctaLinkDescription":null},"metrics":{"reach":646615,"aggregatedReach":646615,"estimatedSpend":5820,"duplicates":7,"reachDelta1d":null,"reachDelta7d":null,"reachDelta30d":16328},"audience":{"targetedCountries":["AU","CA","GB","US"],"mainCountry":"GB","gender":null,"ageMin":null,"ageMax":null},"rank":{"positionInPage":1,"currentRank":1,"rankDelta":null,"improvementPct":0.26},"flags":{"isEuAd":null,"isLowReach":false,"isMediaChanged":true,"hasPartnerBadge":false},"transcript":{"language":"en","languageConfidence":null,"segments":[{"start":0,"end":10.32,"text":"Is it true you can flush all the sugar out of your blood through your urine? Yes. And it's something ninety eight percent of diabetics have no clue about. I'm a pancreatic cancer research doctor,"},{"start":10.48,"end":12.24,"text":"and if I were gonna die tomorrow,"},{"start":12.24,"end":18.475,"text":"I'd want every diabetic, including you, to stop asking God to deliver you from type two diabetes."},{"start":18.475,"end":20.075,"text":"He already sent the answer."},{"start":20.235,"end":29.355,"text":"You're the one refusing to reach for it. Now I'm gonna spit in the face of big pharma and expose the three biggest lies they tell you about type two diabetes."},{"start":29.73,"end":41.489998,"text":"By the end, you'll know how to address the real problem once and for all. Give me sixty seconds to explain. Lie number one. Type two diabetes is caused by eating too much sugar or getting old. That's outdated."},{"start":41.65,"end":48.934998,"text":"Type two diabetes is actually a cellular door disease. The doors on your cells stopped opening. Insulin knocks, but nothing answers."},{"start":49.095,"end":58.055,"text":"So every gram of sugar from every meal stays trapped in your bloodstream with nowhere to go. That trapped sugar grinds through the lining of every blood vessel in your body,"},{"start":58.83,"end":78.475,"text":"after day, year after year, destroying your feet, your kidneys, your eyes, and your heart. That's why cutting carbs, fasting, or walking for hours does almost nothing. The doors are still closed. The sugar is still trapped. The grinding never stops. Lie number two, metformin or Ozempic fixes the problem. That's ridiculous."},{"start":78.635,"end":102.95,"text":"Metformin tells your liver to make less sugar. It never opens the doors. Ozempic slows your stomach, so less sugar enters your blood. It never opens the doors. Yardiance forces sugar out through your kidneys and wears them down while it does it. None of them touch the trapped sugar that's already grinding through your vessels right now. It's like turning down the faucet while the drain is clogged. The water stays. Lie number three."},{"start":103.835,"end":106.23499,"text":"Type two diabetes is irreversible,"},{"start":106.235,"end":118.715,"text":"and you'll be managing it until the day you die. It's criminal that they keep telling you this. Research has identified two compounds from true Ceylon cinnamon that address both halves. The first is called MHCP."},{"start":118.715,"end":129.29001,"text":"It signals the doors on your cells to start opening again. And once those doors open, the trapped sugar finally moves out of your blood and into your cells where it gets burned for energy, the grinding stops."},{"start":129.45,"end":131.77,"text":"The second is called cinnamaldehyde."},{"start":131.77,"end":139.505,"text":"It repairs the vessel lining the trapped sugar has been destroying for years. It helps your vessels produce nitric oxide again,"},{"start":139.82501,"end":148.97,"text":"the signal that tells them to relax and carry blood back to the places