{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RQP5YdfLysVpJQnFXzgYmS","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (85.9KB). Full output saved to: /Users/kalethabh/.claude/projects/-Users-kalethabh-Anuncios-con-IA/f17f1593-2f67-4602-83cb-0d79fa14ee5c/tool-results/toolu_01RQP5YdfLysVpJQnFXzgYmS.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\n{\"requestId\":\"01053198-6370-4218-af68-476123af0cc4\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1474205961228342\",\"collationId\":\"2196202077601005\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-02T04:12:34.540Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-10-31T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T19:11:51.647Z\",\"daysRunning\":27,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/738839f9e96c2042dd4eeb44bc585aabe4f2d566808956a9a1d3c9419d2b48e1.png\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1013442788524883\",\"name\":\"Caroline Moore\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1013442788524883.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1013442788524883\",\"liveAdsCount\":3389,\"reach30d\":1144134,\"totalReach\":2517956,\"countriesCount\":2,\"facebookLikes\":1884,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"I need to tell you something that will make you f*cking livid about your doctor.\\n\\nMy name is Caroline. I am 62 years old. I have been a Type 2 diabetic for 15 years. Take Metformin twice a day, every morning and every night.\\n\\nAnd for the last five years, I have had diabetic neuropathy in both feet. The last three years, the burning and the numbness have gotten worse every single month no matter what I did.\\n\\nAnd when I say no matter what I did, I mean every damn thing.\\n\\nGabapentin for almost three years. Made me foggy enough that I would forget conversations my husband and I just had. Gained 18 pounds. Still woke up at 3am with my feet on fire.\\n\\nTried Lyrica next. $380 a month out of pocket. Worse than the Gabapentin. Felt like I was wearing a wet blanket over my brain. Could not think straight in the kitchen.\\n\\nI took B12. I took Alpha Lipoic Acid. I bought one of those expensive advanced nerve formulas off Amazon with four thousand five-star reviews.\\n\\nNothing.\\n\\nI stopped taking my morning walks. Stopped going out to the garden at sunrise. Stopped going to my granddaughter's dance recitals because sitting on those hard auditorium seats felt like sitting on \n...\n</persisted-output>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018c6j4BBLrReQGZf4cZL9L6","agent_id":"a5dca292aa3337a43","session_id":"f17f1593-2f67-4602-83cb-0d79fa14ee5c","uuid":"9d3418ae-1bb9-4136-aef6-a1d325736b50","timestamp":"2026-11-27T18:50:38.687Z","tool_use_result":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"trendtrack-server","version":"0.0.1"}}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RQP5YdfLysVpJQnFXzgYmS","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Extraer hooks del mercado Ceylon"}
