{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FSMfCqBRYkWFmT9isH1Fdv","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"9ab74e88-4a1a-4d77-81ca-6711c9efb855\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_2018670738995624\",\"collationId\":\"1196957505854593\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-02-18T05:55:26.318Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-02-17T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-30T16:43:42.877Z\",\"daysRunning\":225,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/409235f9889b79ff56eaa4755b8ebfd0943c98db54d4e2a88eb62cdd34fc77c6.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/6fb4def7a3c41884923c0e813f3e98ca1d8db29299062f94c7f1ba79f92a70f3.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"107729798750017\",\"name\":\"Roots & Remedies\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/107729798750017.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"107729798750017\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":127890,\"countriesCount\":3,\"facebookLikes\":1370,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Does this sound like your daily reality?\\n\\n❌ Waking up tired, no matter how much you sleep. ❌ That uncontrollable \\\"crash\\\" around 3 PM. ❌ Brain fog that makes it hard to focus. ❌ Numbers that spike even when you eat \\\"healthy.\\\"\\n\\nYou aren’t alone, and it’s not just about willpower. It’s about cellular sensitivity.\\n\\nPrimal Remedies helps your body \\\"remember\\\" how to process sugar properly again. Instead of forcing numbers down with harsh chemicals, we use True Ceylon Cinnamon + MCT Oil to support your body’s natural rhythm.\\n\\nIt’s not just about the numbers on the meter—it’s about how you feel all day long.\\n👇\\nhttps://primal-remedies.com/pages/adv1-news-cinnamon\",\"transcript\":\"Three bags of Primal Remedies for the price of just one, and here's how to get it. Today only. Tap that link below to unlock a special flash sale price. Choose the 2 plus 1 free option and get free shipping. But you do have to hurry. This flash deal ends tonight.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://primal-remedies.com/pages/adv1-news-cinnamon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"primal-remedies.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"OFFERS ENDS TODAY 23.59\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":33192,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":299,\"duplicates\":5,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":1,\"currentRank\":1,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":100},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_907056195031356\",\"collationId\":\"877298521849780\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-21T21:00:55.406Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-02-12T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-17T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":217,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/27d3494357faebd1085ad5b385cb090de09db3ce8f8ab2e0f2e5cb2d0b553d7e.png\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"136476209541485\",\"name\":\"Primal Remedies Secrets\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/136476209541485.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"136476209541485\",\"liveAdsCount\":3,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":425212,\"countriesCount\":4,\"facebookLikes\":324,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Looking for a natural way to support healthy blood sugar?\\nMost people don’t know there’s a huge difference between regular cinnamon and true Ceylon cinnamon.\\n\\nCeylon — used for centuries — contains far lower coumarin levels and is prized for its cleaner, gentler profile.\\n\\nPrimal Remedies Ceylon Cinnamon Softgels deliver a high-potency extract combined with premium MCT oil for superior absorption and real daily support.\\nTry it today risk-free for 60 days with our money-back guarantee.\\nhttps://primal-remedies.com/pages/adv1-news-cinnamon\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://primal-remedies.com/pages/adv1-news-cinnamon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"primal-remedies.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"VALENTINE SALE ENDS TODAY 23.59\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":74944,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":674,\"duplicates\":3,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":15,\"currentRank\":15,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":15.46},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_2903054866725383\",\"collationId\":\"1488520082622502\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-24T05:34:20.650Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-03-08T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-30T15:55:35.569Z\",\"daysRunning\":206,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/16a072eccefb5b49ebdb94611e6a1cf3db047ba2e66e98ab67fb8ee626aed101.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/8cb19dbcde7004801eed3c0c45bb0cdb1a071c5514c1bfb7a24135720bd85247.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"115233253641269\",\"name\":\"Mark Callahan\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/115233253641269.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"115233253641269\",\"liveAdsCount\":185,\"reach30d\":264,\"totalReach\":1144611,\"countriesCount\":3,\"facebookLikes\":420,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Your doctor said \\\"prediabetic.\\\"\\nThat word hit different than you expected. Because now every meal feels like a test. Every morning glucose check feels like a verdict.\\nBut here's what they probably didn't explain:\\nPrediabetes isn't just about eating less sugar. Your cells have started resisting insulin — meaning the glucose in your blood has nowhere to go. That's why your numbers stay elevated even when you're doing \\\"everything right.\\\"\\nThe active compound in Ceylon cinnamon — cinnamaldehyde — mimics insulin at the cellular level. It helps your cells open up and absorb glucose again. But here's the catch most people miss: cinnamaldehyde is fat-soluble. Standard powder capsules can't deliver it properly. Your body just flushes it.\\nThat's why this uses MCT oil to carry the compound directly into your cells — one softgel delivers what 12 standard capsules try to.\\n7,200mg of True Ceylon Cinnamon. Suspended in organic MCT oil. Thousands of 5-star reviews.\\n🔥 Buy 2 Get 1 FREE + FREE Shipping\\n✅ 90-Day Money-Back Guarantee — if your numbers don't improve, send it back. Every penny.\\nYou caught it early. You still have the window. Don't waste it 👇\\nThese statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Always consult your healthcare provider before making changes to your supplement routine.\\nhttps://primal-remedies.com/pages/adv1-news-cinnamon\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://primal-remedies.com/pages/adv1-news-cinnamon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"primal-remedies.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"OFFERS ENDS TODAY 23.59\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":4669,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":42,\"duplicates\":4,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":38,\"currentRank\":38,\"rankDelta\":n