cal aftertaste.\\nNo flavourings approximating something natural.\\n\\n🌻 Sunflower seeds\\n🤎 Dates\\n✨ Sea salt\\n🌿 A real flavour ingredient like Ceylon cinnamon\\n\\n✅ 21g complete protein\\n✅ 7g natural fibre\\n✅ Four ingredients · Nothing added\\n\\nFour flavours. All made the same way. All tasting like the real thing.\\n\\nUse code NEW10 for 10% off your first order — stacks with 34% off four bags.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"ORDER NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://www.proteinandfibre.co.uk/products/natural-protein-fibre-powder\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"proteinandfibre.co.uk\",\"ctaDescription\":\"20 ingredients to hide behind. We have four to be proud of.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Use code NEW10 for 10% off — stacks with 34% multibuy saving on four bags.\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":1757964,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":15822,\"duplicates\":2,\"reachDelta1d\":4761,\"reachDelta7d\":53346,\"reachDelta30d\":407163},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":1,\"currentRank\":1,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":10},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1606169527981606\",\"collationId\":\"959616150240092\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-08T13:42:07.189Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-07T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T07:38:00.097Z\",\"daysRunning\":20,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/c0e295f6de178e0adcdbbc09f36774d57f4be6f6e2cf7483812537c3f6e75ebe.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/6cded6b9bc83529bacd006697d1306ab83327ab5f800971cc93b62f92a36505e.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"109030695414\",\"name\":\"Dilmah Tea\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/109030695414.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"10