{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016BG1mzr5H9LPAvkUfBDUDH","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (115.4KB). Full output saved to: /Users/kalethabh/.claude/projects/-Users-kalethabh-Anuncios-con-IA/f17f1593-2f67-4602-83cb-0d79fa14ee5c/tool-results/toolu_016BG1mzr5H9LPAvkUfBDUDH.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\n{\"requestId\":\"599c36ec-3ed7-4afb-9acd-0be22c47f850\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1162997996107877\",\"collationId\":\"3603831369788153\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-26T03:24:19.858Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-25T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-27T03:18:45.178Z\",\"daysRunning\":2,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/24fb111dc230b29b860cc1e034094c02e76834a3c3f5131cff6bddff7bf5849f.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/a4c0d407588ee13d2bd728c30d8a8c55ca119bdb8cf14a3e5488c435816413c4.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"114663451729513\",\"name\":\"Zach McMullen Hudson\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/114663451729513.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"114663451729513\",\"liveAdsCount\":15,\"reach30d\":12,\"totalReach\":784,\"countriesCount\":6,\"facebookLikes\":3,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"I don't give a f*ck if this upsets you. I am going to say something that no woman who's 60+ with Type 2 diabetes wants to hear.\\n⠀\\nI cut out carbs and sweets on July 8th, 2024. Threw out every loaf of bread, every snack, every box of pasta in the house. Went full keto. Walked three miles a day. Started juicing kale, of all things. I did everything I would have told any of my patients to do. I had a massive heart attack on October 19th at 2 AM.\\n⠀\\nI was 61 years old.\\n⠀\\nI've been a Certified Diabetes Educator for 24 years.\\n⠀\\nI taught this protocol to over four thousand patients across two decades. I ran group classes at the hospital every Tuesday and Thursday evening. I sat across from newly diagnosed Type 2 patients and their spouses and told them exactly what to do. Cut the bread. Cut the rice. Cut the pasta. Take the M*tformin. Walk every day. Retest in three months.\\n⠀\\nI told them this would work.\\n⠀\\nI taught them the same protocol I ended up doing myself.\\n⠀\\nAnd it almost killed me.\\n⠀\\nThe paramedics got me back. The cardiologist put in two stents. But I nea\n...\n</persisted-output>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BM6ojhxoKRmXtc5hHHY9MK","agent_id":"a93b4961117d83ab3","session_id":"f17f1593-2f67-4602-83cb-0d79fa14ee5c","uuid":"d0aeef96-0da8-43ca-abb1-9fc6168c9840","timestamp":"2026-11-27T18:51:11.638Z","tool_use_result":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"trendtrack-server","version":"0.0.1"}}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016BG1mzr5H9LPAvkUfBDUDH","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Validación Colombia canela Ceylán"}
