\n\\nEn Estados Unidos, normalmente te ofrecen metformina… y tú terminas buscando alternativas en Google a las 11 de la noche.\\n\\nPero aquí está la parte importante: por qué funciona.\\n\\nEn 1996, investigadores de la Universidad de Toronto publicaron un estudio en la revista *Diabetes* mostrando que el R-ALA no solo funciona como antioxidante.\\n\\nTambién ayuda a activar los transportadores GLUT4 en las células musculares.\\n\\nLos mismos transportadores que activa la insulina.\\n\\nEn otras palabras: ayuda a abrir el drenaje.\\n\\nEl R-ALA le manda una señal a tus músculos para que acepten la glucosa y la usen como energía.\\n\\nUn estudio de seguimiento publicado en 2001 también lo describió como un agente antihiperglucémico.\\n\\nY un metaanálisis de 2022 que revisó 16 estudios con más de 1,000 pacientes encontró reducciones significativas en la glucosa en ayunas y en la HbA1c.\\n\\nEl efecto más fuerte se vio con 600 mg al día.\\n\\nLa berberina baja la llave.\\n\\nEl R-ALA ayuda a abrir el drenaje.\\n\\nPor eso una cosa puede estancarse… y la otra puede ayudar a mover ese número de la mañana.\\n\\nAhora, si ya probaste ácido alfa lipoico y no sentiste nada, entiendo perfectamente tu duda.\\n\\nPero hay una razón muy específica por la que tal vez no te funcionó.\\n\\nLa mayoría de los suplementos de ALA que se venden en internet —incluyendo marcas populares de Amazon de $15 a $25— son racémicos.\\n\\nEso significa que son una mezcla 50/50 de dos formas moleculares: la forma R y la forma S.\\n\\nLa forma R es la que tu cuerpo produce naturalmente.\\n\\nEs la que activa GLUT4.\\n\\nEs la que se usó en los estudios clínicos alemanes.\\n\\nLa forma S es una versión sintética que puede competir con la forma R durante la absorción.\\n\\nO sea, la mitad de la cápsula era la parte que querías.\\n\\nY la otra mitad podía estar estorbando.\\n\\nPor eso quizá no viste resultados.\\n\\nNuestra fórmula usa 100% R-ALA puro, estabilizado como Na-RALA, una forma diseñada para ofrecer niveles más altos y más sostenidos en la sangre que el R-ALA común.\\n\\nSin mezcla racémica.\\n\\nSin forma S compitiendo.\\n\\nSin relleno barato.\\n\\nAdemás, está combinado con metilcobalamina B12 y benfotiamina, nutrientes clave para apoyar la salud nerviosa y metabólica.\\n\\n600 mg.\\n\\nLa misma dosis usada en estudios clínicos.\\n\\nEl isómero correcto.\\n\\nProbado por laboratorios externos.\\n\\nHecho en Estados Unidos.\\n\\nSin malestar gastrointestinal.\\n\\nSin niebla mental.\\n\\nSin agotar tu vitamina B12.\\n\\nY con garantía de devolución de dinero por 90 días.\\n\\nMide tu glucosa en ayunas por 60 días.\\n\\nY si no ves cambio, no pagas nada.\\n\\nTu próxima prueba de A1C ya está marcada en el calendario.\\n\\nY hay un momento que toda persona con prediabetes imagina.\\n\\nEntras al consultorio.\\n\\nEl médico abre tus resultados.\\n\\nHace una pausa.\\n\\nTe mira y dice:\\n\\n“Lo que estés haciendo, sigue haciéndolo. Hoy no tenemos que hablar de metformina.”\\n\\nLos endocrinólogos en Alemania llevan años ayudando a sus pacientes a llegar a ese momento.\\n\\nAhora tú también sabes lo que ellos saben.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://venturostore.com/products/noverly-acido-alfa-lipoico-ala\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"venturostore.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"50% Solo Por Hoy🔥\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":14,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"CO\"],\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":5,\"currentRank\":5,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":9.8},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_2125209385034898\",\"collationId\":\"1882130179818747\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-22T14:21:55.287Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-22T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-10-29T16:51:30.683Z\",\"daysRunning\":37,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/6b29f04760e2d42b3e89c4985541b3e66a35371f5dad33497aea088533c8d549.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/7ec1863000c17de9b71d0cd5dcd301106742dee148feeac02e37933181be1938.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1023779307483612\",\"name\":\"Venturo Store\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1023779307483612.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1023779307483612\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":0,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":189,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Si tu glucosa en ayunas sigue subiendo cada vez que te haces análisis — aunque ya mejoraste tu alimentación, caminas después de cenar y hasta probaste berberina — no es porque te falte fuerza de voluntad.\\n\\nEs porque tal vez has estado atacando solo la mitad del problema.\\n\\nY esto es algo que a muchos médicos en Estados Unidos nunca les explicaron bien: por qué la glucosa en ayunas puede ser tan difícil de bajar.\\n\\nTu azúcar en la sangre no depende solamente de cuánta azúcar comes.\\n\\nTambién depende de si tus músculos pueden sacar esa azúcar de la sangre y usarla como energía.\\n\\nY cuando ese sistema deja de funcionar bien, no necesariamente por tu dieta, sino porque tus células ya no responden como deberían, cortar más carbohidratos no siempre arregla el número de las 6 de la mañana.\\n\\nPiénsalo así.\\n\\nTu cuerpo tiene como dos controles para la glucosa: una llave de agua y un drenaje.\\n\\nLa llave es tu hígado. Tu hígado produce y libera glucosa en la sangre.\\n\\nEl drenaje son tus músculos. Dentro de tus células musculares hay transportadores llamados GLUT4, que ayudan a sacar la glucosa de la sangre para usarla como energía.\\n\\nLa mayoría de los suplementos naturales que la gente prueba para la glucosa —berberina, canela, vinagre de manzana— trabajan principalmente en la llave.\\n\\nAyudan a que el hígado libere menos glucosa.\\n\\nPor eso, si probaste berberina, quizá viste algo muy común: al principio ayudó por unas semanas… y luego se estancó.\\n\\nPorque el drenaje seguía tapado.\\n\\nCuando GLUT4 deja de activarse correctamente, la glucosa no tiene a dónde ir.\\n\\nSe queda en la sangre.\\n\\nY aparece en la mañana como 112.\\n\\nLuego 115.\\n\\nLuego 118.\\n\\nComes más limpio.\\n\\nCaminas más.\\n\\nTe esfuerzas más.\\n\\nPero el número no se mueve.\\n\\nEso no significa que estés fallando.\\n\\nSignifica que el drenaje no está funcionando como debería.\\n\\nLa respuesta más común del sistema médico para este problema suele ser metformina.\\n\\nPero la metformina tampoco repara el drenaje.\\n\\nLo que hace principalmente es decirle al hígado que produzca menos glucosa. O sea, aprieta más la llave. Muy parecido al mecanismo de la berberina.\\n\\nY muchas personas con la versión de liberación inmediata terminan lidiando con problemas digestivos fuertes, como diarrea intensa, náuseas o malestar estomacal.\\n\\nAlgunas personas incluso tienen que llevar ropa extra al trabajo.\\n\\nUna paciente contó que compró una máquina para limpiar alfombras por culpa de los accidentes causados por su medicamento para la diabetes.\\n\\nOtra escribió: “No puedo decirte cuántas veces vomité camino al trabajo.”\\n\\nY lo más irónico es esto:\\n\\nEl uso prolongado de metformina puede bajar tus niveles de vitamina B12.\\n\\nY cuando baja la B12, puede aumentar el riesgo de daño en los nervios, como hormigueo, ardor o entumecimiento en pies y manos.\\n\\nJusto el tipo de complicación que estás tratando de evitar.\\n\\nTu médico no te está mintiendo.\\n\\nEstá usando la herramienta que le enseñaron a usar.\\n\\nPero esa herramienta no siempre está diseñada para la parte del problema que tú realmente necesitas corregir.\\n\\nAhora escucha esto.\\n\\nEn Alemania, desde 1966, las autoridades médicas aprobaron un compuesto llamado ácido alfa lipoico R.\\n\\nNo como suplemento.\\n\\nComo medicamento de receta.\\n\\nY fue aprobado por lo que hace en el metabolismo de la glucosa y en la salud de los nervios relacionados con la diabetes.\\n\\nDurante décadas, endocrinólogos en Alemania lo han usado con sus pacientes.\\n\\nMás de 4,000 personas han participado en estudios clínicos importantes.\\n\\nLa dosis usada en esos estudios: 600 mg.\\n\\nMejoras medibles en la glucosa en 3 a 5 semanas.\\n\\nSin diarrea explosiva.\\n\\nSin bajar la vitamina B12.\\n\\nSin tener que comprar una máquina para limpiar alfombras.\\n\\nEntonces, ¿por qué casi nadie habla de esto en Estados Unidos?\\n\\nPorque una molécula natural no se puede patentar de la misma forma que un medicamento nuevo.\\n\\nEl ácido alfa lipoico es algo que tu propio cuerpo ya produce en pequeñas cantidades dentro de las mitocondrias.\\n\\nY si una compañía no puede tener control exclusivo sobre una molécula, no hay el mismo incentivo para gastar millones en promocionarla.\\n\\nPor eso no hay representantes farmacéuticos entrando a los consultorios a educar a los médicos sobre R-ALA.\\n\\nNo hay una gran campaña detrás.\\n\\nEn Alemania, muchos médicos lo conocen y lo usan.\\n\\nEn Estados Unidos, normalmente te ofrecen metformina… y tú terminas buscando alternativas en Google a las 11 de la noche.\\n\\nPero aquí está la parte importante: por qué funciona.\\n\\nEn 1996, investigadores de la Universidad de Toronto publicaron un estudio en la revista *Diabetes* mostrando que el R-ALA no solo funciona como antioxidante.\\n\\nTambién ayuda a activar los transportadores GLUT4 en las células musculares.\\n\\nLos mismos transportadores que activa la insulina.\\n\\nEn otras palabras: ayuda a abrir el drenaje.\\n\\nEl R-ALA le manda una señal a tus músculos para que acepten la glucosa y la usen como energía.\\n\\nUn estudio de seguimiento publicado en 2001 también lo describió como un agente antihiperglucémico.\\n\\nY un metaanálisis de 2022 que revisó 16 estudios con más de 1,000 pacientes encontró reducciones significativas en la glucosa en ayunas y en la HbA1c.\\n\\nEl efecto más fuerte se vio con 600 mg al día.\\n\\nLa berberina baja la llave.\\n\\nEl R-ALA ayuda a abrir el drenaje.\\n\\nPor eso una cosa puede estancarse… y la otra puede ayudar a mover ese número de la mañana.\\n\\nAhora, si ya probaste ácido alfa lipoico y no sentiste nada, entiendo perfectamente tu duda.\\n\\nPero hay una razón muy específica por la que tal vez no te funcionó.\\n\\nLa mayoría de los suplementos de ALA que se venden en internet —incluyendo marcas populares de Amazon de $15 a $25— son racémicos.\\n\\nEso significa que son una mezcla 50/50 de dos formas moleculares: la forma R y la forma S.\\n\\nLa forma R es la que tu cuerpo produce naturalmente.\\n\\nEs la que activa GLUT4.\\n\\nEs la que se usó en los estudios clínicos alemanes.\\n\\nLa forma S es una versión sintética que puede competir con la forma R durante la absorción.\\n\\nO sea, la mitad de la cápsula era la parte que querías.\\n\\nY la otra mitad podía estar estorbando.\\n\\nPor eso quizá no viste resultados.\\n\\nNuestra fórmula usa 100% R-ALA puro, estabilizado como Na-RALA, una forma diseñada para ofrecer niveles más altos y más sostenidos en la sangre que el R-ALA común.\\n\\nSin mezcla racémica.\\n\\nSin forma S compitiendo.\\n\\nSin relleno barato.\\n\\nAdemás, está combinado con metilcobalamina B12 y benfotiamina, nutrientes clave para apoyar la salud nerviosa y metabólica.\\n\\n600 mg.\\n\\nLa misma dosis usada en estudios clínicos.\\n\\nEl isómero correcto.\\n\\nProbado por laboratorios externos.\\n\\nHecho en Estados Unidos.\\n\\nSin malestar gastrointestinal.\\n\\nSin niebla mental.\\n\\nSin agotar tu vitamina B12.\\n\\nY con garantía de devolución de dinero por 90 días.\\n\\nMide tu glucosa en ayunas por 60 días.\\n\\nY si no ves cambio, no pagas nada.\\n\\nTu próxima prueba de A1C ya está marcada en el calendario.\\n\\nY hay un momento que toda persona con prediabetes imagina.\\n\\nEntras al consultorio.\\n\\nEl médico abre tus resultados.\\n\\nHace una pausa.\\n\\nTe mira y dice:\\n\\n“Lo que estés haciendo, sigue haciéndolo. Hoy no tenemos que hablar de metformina.”\\n\\nLos endocrinólogos en Alemania llevan años ayudando a sus pacientes a llegar a ese momento.\\n\\nAhora tú también sabes lo que ellos saben.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://venturostore.com/products/noverly-acido-alfa-lipoico-ala\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"venturostore.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"50% Solo Por Hoy🔥\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":11,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"CO\"],\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":31,\"currentRank\":31,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":50.82},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_2220498855395003\",\"collationId\":\"4124910321133503\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T21:40:45.828Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-08-15T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-02T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":18,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/04bdceae83486d1e82ddf5c1b530a10bb4422dca1ba99c05eefc1c1c6ff99486.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/b132ad2886b27954ff3907da8bdc0e987cb2e7e2a1a7679827241c867af1b516.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"105052632363258\",\"name\":\"pocion_magica\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/105052632363258.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"105052632363258\",\"liveAdsCount\":97,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":0,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":11214,\"instagramFollowers\":134680},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"✨ ¿Estreñimiento, hinchazón o digestión lenta? ¡En Pociones Mágicas tenemos la solución! Nuestra fibra combina linaza, avena, psyllium, pitaya, piña y más para:\\n🔹 Combatir el estreñimiento y mejorar el tránsito intestinal.\\n🔹 Reducir el colesterol malo y proteger tu corazón.\\n🔹 Regular los niveles de azúcar en la sangre.\\n🔹 Eliminar toxinas y sentirte más ligero(a) cada día.\\n🔹 Controlar el apetito.\\n🍀 Siente el cambio desde el primer día:menos hinchazón y una digestión en equilibrio.\\n🙋\u200d♀️Te sientes indentificad@ ? Escríbeme y recibe una asesoría personalizada 👩\u200d⚕️\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"VIEW INSTAGRAM PROFILE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://instagram.com/pocion_magica\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"instagram.com\",\"ctaDescription\":null,\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":10,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"CO\"],\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":15,\"currentRank\":15,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":22.73},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}}],\"pagination\":{\"page\":1,\"limit\":4,\"total\":1468,\"totalPages\":367,\"offset\":0,\"isTotalApproximate\":false},\"meta\":{\"query\":\"azúcar en la sangre\",\"keywords\":[],\"searchIn\":\"ad_copy\",\"categoryIds\":[],\"country\":null,\"countryFilterKind\":\"audienceCountry\",\"adCountries\":{\"include\":[\"CO\"]},\"mainCountries\":[],\"trendSignal\":\"reach_growth_7d\",\"sortBy\":\"mostDuplicates\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"requestedLimit\":4,\"effectiveLimit\":4,\"activeOnly\":true,\"status\":\"all\",\"page\":1,\"minTrafficGrowthPercent\":null,\"trafficGrowthPeriod\":\"last30d\",\"trafficGrowth\":null,\"adsGrowth\":null,\"pageReachGrowth\":null,\"adReachGrowth\":null,\"language\":null,\"adLanguages\":[],\"cta\":[],\"currency\":null,\"currencies\":[],\"shopifyAppIds\":[],\"excludeShopifyAppIds\":[],\"pixelIds\":[],\"excludePixelIds\":[],\"themeIds\":[],\"filters\":{\"search\":[\"azúcar en la sangre\"],\"searchType\":\"adCopy\",\"keywordMode\":\"any\",\"sortBy\":\"mostDuplicates\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"page\":1,\"limit\":4,\"platforms\":[\"facebook\"],\"status\":\"all\",\"adCountries\":{\"include\":[\"CO\"]}},\"warnings\":[],\"paginationMaxOffset\":10000},\"fieldGuide\":{\"countryBreakdowns\":[{\"path\":\"data[].audience.targetedCountries\",\"meaning\":\"Full ad targeting country list, including non-EU markets such as US.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].audience.mainCountry\",\"meaning\":\"Primary audience country from Meta's EU/UK ad transparency data; null for ads outside that scope, even when the ad targets those markets.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].advertiser.countriesCount\",\"meaning\":\"Number of advertiser countries detected; not a country split.\"}],\"richNestedData\":[{\"path\":\"data[].collationId\",\"meaning\":\"Identifier of the combined creative represented by this search result. Pass it as scan_ad.collation_id to scan the same aggregate instead of only the representative ad.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].advertiser\",\"meaning\":\"Facebook page identity, reach, followers, and live ads.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].content\",\"meaning\":\"Ad copy, transcript fallback, CTA, and landing page.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].media\",\"meaning\":\"Media type, thumbnails, and media URLs.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].metrics\",\"meaning\":\"Reach, spend estimate, deltas, and duplicate metrics.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].audience\",\"meaning\":\"Country, gender, and age targeting fields.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].flags\",\"meaning\":\"EU, low-reach, media-changed, and partner-badge flags.\"}]},\"credits\":{\"requestedUnits\":4,\"effectiveUnits\":4,\"actualUnits\":4,\"costUnits\":6,\"recurringUnits\":6,\"topupUnits\":0,\"creditsRemaining\":9551,\"creditsSourceHeader\":\"recurring\",\"failurePhase\":null,\"releaseAttempted\":false,\"releaseSucceeded\":null}}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BM6ojhxoKRmXtc5hHHY9MK","agent_id":"a93b4961117d83ab3","session_id":"f17f1593-2f67-4602-83cb-0d79fa14ee5c","uuid":"22a8da1e-5ba4-491f-b04f-b0bc0acbd82a","timestamp":"2026-11-27T18:51:17.152Z","tool_use_result":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"trendtrack-server","version":"0.0.1"}}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MKdcPjSMqWNyevjD3G6aHk","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Validación Colombia canela Ceylán"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tp2ujRgs7qYCzCY9oH7mpH","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"32961089-fb38-45ed-bc22-b5b41a7de1e5\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1589877466241155\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-26T19:50:45.819Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T19:51:00.245Z\",\"daysRunning\":1,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/f75170f4ec957eac0297d9acbad3c599f43b8ff70c9119b8c61bd4b96f53adb0.jpg\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"115719964955088\",\"name\":\"Youth Pro\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/115719964955088.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"115719964955088\",\"liveAdsCount\":15,\"reach30d\":63,\"totalReach\":1354,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":14,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"The day I bought adult diapers at 60, right after my Type 2 diagnosis, the cashier gave me one look that made me want to disappear into the floor...\\n\\nBut what choice did I have? The diarrhea had started. Especially after Metformin. And everyone knows what comes next, right?\\n\\nI was preparing for the inevitable decline. Buying products meant for my 89-year-old mother-in-law who lived in assisted care.\\n\\nExcept here's what nobody tells you: I wasn't fighting the disease. I was just managing the wreckage.\\n\\nMy name is Sandra Keller. I've been an ICU nurse for 38 years. I've held the hands of dying diabetics. I've watched Metformin destroy quality of life for decades. I've seen the trajectory.\\n\\nSo when my own fasting glucose hit 187 and my A1C climbed to 7.2, I knew exactly what my doctor would say before she said it.\\n\\nWe need to start you on Metformin.\\n\\nI smiled. Nodded. Took the prescription.\\n\\nAnd threw it away three days later.\\n\\nNot because I'm reckless. Not because I'm in denial. But because I've seen what Metformin does to people who take it, and I've seen what diabetes does to people who don't. Both paths lead to misery. I was trying to find a third option.\\n\\nFor three years, I tried everything else. Apple cider vinegar before meals. Cinnamon in my coffee. Berberine twice daily. I cut carbs so aggressively I was eating 40 grams a day. I walked 10,000 steps. I did resistance training three times a week.\\n\\nMy fasting glucose dropped from 187 to 170. My A1C went from 7.2 to 6.8.\\n\\nBetter. But not good enough. Not even close.\\n\\nAnd the cost? I was exhausted. Irritable. Craving carbs constantly. My brain felt wrapped in cotton by 2 PM every single day. I'd wake up at 3 AM to pee, check my glucose out of habit. Still 160. Lie there until 4:30 AM unable to fall back asleep.\\n\\nI was doing everything right and still losing.\\n\\nMy husband found me crying in the bathroom one night at 11 PM, staring at my glucose meter. 192. After a dinner of grilled chicken and broccoli.\\n\\nJust take the damn Metformin, he said.\\n\\nI can't, I whispered. I've seen what it does.\\n\\nBut I was running out of options. And the thought that crossed my mind was worse than the diarrhea, worse than the sleepless nights. I'd watched uncontrolled blood sugar work through patients for nearly four decades. The kidneys go first, quietly, while the numbers look manageable. Then the nerves. Then the eyes. I knew exactly where this road ended if I couldn't get the glucose down.\\n\\nThen something happened that changed everything.\\n\\nI was discharging a patient. Type 2 diabetic, 61 years old, admitted three months earlier with a foot ulcer. Standard progression for someone whose blood sugar had been out of control for years.\\n\\nBut this time, something was different.\\n\\nHe looked lighter. Not just physically. His whole energy was different. His skin had that glow people get when inflammation drops. He was cracking jokes with the physical therapist.\\n\\nI pulled up his chart. His fasting glucose that morning: 94. Three months ago at admission: 178.\\n\\nI walked back into his room.\\n\\nMr. Patterson. Your blood sugar. What changed?\\n\\nHe grinned. You're not going to believe me.\\n\\nTry me.\\n\\nI stopped taking Metformin.\\n\\nMy stomach dropped. You stopped your medication?\\n\\nThree months ago. Started taking this Ceylon cinnamon supplement my daughter found. At2a. Took about two weeks and my blood sugar just dropped. After a month I felt better than I had in ten years. Talked to my doctor, she ran labs, said whatever I was doing was working. Weaned me off the Metformin.\\n\\nI stared at him.\\n\\nYou're telling me a cinnamon supplement dropped your fasting glucose by 84 points?\\n\\nI'm telling you I sleep through the night now. My brain works again. I'm not chained to a toilet. And my doctor is thrilled with my numbers.\\n\\nI went home that night and couldn't sleep. Not because of my blood sugar. Because of what he had said.\\n\\nI've been a nurse for 38 years. I don't believe in magic pills. I don't trust testimonials. I trust mechanisms and evidence.\\n\\nSo at 2:47 AM, still awake, I started researching.\\n\\nCeylon cinnamon. The true cinnamon, Cinnamomum verum, grown in Sri Lanka. Not the cheap Cassia variety that fills most supplement shelves. The real thing, used in medicine for centuries and now being studied in clinical trials for metabolic disease.\\n\\nThe first study I found was from Japan. Type 2 diabetics given clinical-dose Ceylon cinnamon extract showed significant improvements in insulin sensitivity and fasting glucose after 12 weeks.\\n\\nThe second was from India. Patients with metabolic syndrome showed reduced oxidative stress markers and improved blood sugar metabolism.\\n\\nThe third was from Italy. Ceylon cinnamon's active compound, cinnamaldehyde, reduced inflammatory cytokines and protected pancreatic beta cells from oxidative damage.\\n\\nI kept reading.\\n\\nThe mechanism made sense. Type 2 diabetes isn't just high blood sugar. It's chronic inflammation and oxidative stress damaging your cells' ability to respond to insulin.\\n\\nMetformin forces your liver to produce less glucose. It's a chemical override. It works, but it doesn't address the cellular damage causing the insulin resistance in the first place.\\n\\nCeylon cinnamon works differently. Cinnamaldehyde activates the same metabolic pathways that exercise activates. It moves glucose into cells without relying on insulin. It shuts down the NLRP3 inflammasome, the master switch behind chronic metabolic inflammation. It reduces the oxidative stress that's blocking your insulin receptors and damaging your blood vessels.\\n\\nIt's not forcing anything. It's removing the interference.\\n\\nI ordered cinnamon capsules that morning. Generic ones from Amazon. $14.99.\\n\\nTook two with breakfast on a Monday. Didn't expect anything.\\n\\nThat afternoon at work, something was different. My usual 2 PM crash, the one where my brain shuts off and I need coffee or I'll fall asleep standing up, didn't happen. I was steady. Clear. Functional.\\n\\nI figured it was placebo effect.\\n\\nThat night, I went to bed at 10:30 PM. I woke up at 6:45 AM. I hadn't woken up once. Not to pee. Not with restless legs. Not with my mind racing about tomorrow's shift.\\n\\nI slept through the night for the first time in 14 months.\\n\\nI tested my fasting glucose. 142. Forty-five points lower than my usual 187.\\n\\nI tested again. Same number.\\n\\nI called my husband into the bathroom. Look at this.\\n\\nThat's good, right?\\n\\nThat's the lowest fasting glucose I've had in two years.\\n\\nDay three: 134. Day five: my brain fog was lifting. I could focus during rounds. I could remember patient details without checking my notes three times. Day seven: sleeping through every night. Fasting glucose consistently between 110 and 120.\\n\\nWeek two: 98.\\n\\nI checked it three times because I didn't believe it. I hadn't seen a fasting glucose below 100 in over two years.\\n\\nThe afternoon crashes were gone. The constant thirst was gone. The 3 AM bathroom trips were gone. The diapers were long gone.\\n\\nI felt like myself again.\\n\\nThree months later, I walked into my doctor's office with a printout of my glucose log.\\n\\nShe stared at it for a long time.\\n\\nYour fasting glucose is consistently in the 90s.\\n\\nYes.\\n\\nYour A1C is 5.8. Down from 7.2.\\n\\nYes.\\n\\nShe looked up at me. What did you do?\\n\\nI didn't take the Metformin.\\n\\nHer face hardened. Sandra.\\n\\nI took Ceylon cinnamon. Concentrated extract, 7,200mg equivalent, suspended in MCT oil. There are studies. I brought them.\\n\\nI handed her a folder with six published papers.\\n\\nShe flipped through them. Read for five minutes. Closed the folder.\\n\\nYour kidney function improved. Your creatinine is 1.1. It was 1.4 three months ago.\\n\\nI nodded.\\n\\nKidney function doesn't improve. Once you hit stage 2, the goal is to slow the decline. Not reverse it. But you reversed it.\\n\\nI know.\\n\\nShe sat back in her chair. Keep doing whatever you're doing.\\n\\nThat was seven months ago.\\n\\nMy fasting glucose is consistently between 90 and 100. My A1C is 5.6. My kidney function is stable in the normal range. I sleep through every single night. The afternoon crashes are gone. The brain fog is gone. My irritability, the thing my husband had learned to just tolerate, is gone.\\n\\nI feel like I did ten years ago.\\n\\nNow here is what I need to tell you, because most people make the same mistake I made first.\\n\\nThe generic capsules I ordered from Amazon moved my numbers by maybe 10 points over two weeks. Noticeable, but not life-changing. Not anywhere close to what happened when I switched to At2a, the product Mr. Patterson had named. The difference between those two results comes down to three things, and understanding them explains why most people take cinnamon for months and see almost nothing.\\n\\nThe first is species. What is sold as cinnamon in most supplements, and in most grocery stores, is Cassia. A completely different plant from Ceylon. Grown in China, not Sri Lanka. Cassia contains up to 250 times more coumarin, a compound linked to liver damage with daily long-term use. Your body processes it differently. The clinical studies showing meaningful blood sugar results were conducted on true Ceylon cinnamon, Cinnamomum verum, not Cassia. Most brands will not tell you which one they are using. Some cannot tell you, because they do not actually know.\\n\\nThe second is dose. Clinical studies showing meaningful blood sugar results used concentrated Ceylon extract equivalent to 6,000 to 7,200mg of whole cinnamon daily. Most capsules contain 500 to 1,500mg of powder. A fraction of what actually moves the numbers. You could take the right species and still see nothing, because the dose is nowhere near therapeutic.\\n\\nThe third is delivery. Cinnamon's active compounds, cinnamaldehyde and the polyphenols, are fat-soluble. They need fat to absorb properly. Dry powder capsules have poor bioavailability. The right carrier is MCT oil from coconuts, which increases absorption dramatically and adds its own independent benefit to insulin sensitivity through a separate pathway.\\n\\nThe generic capsules I tried first had none of these three things right. Wrong species, wrong dose, wrong delivery. That is why they moved my glucose 10 points instead of 87.\\n\\nAt2a gets all three right. True Ceylon cinnamon, Cinnamomum verum, sourced from Sri Lanka. Dosed at 7,200mg equivalent per softgel as a 12:1 concentrated extract. Suspended in MCT oil from coconuts. Third-party tested, GMP-certified, every batch verified for purity, potency, and coumarin levels. One softgel every morning with breakfast. That is the protocol.\\n\\nOne thing I want to be direct about. At2a is not sold on Amazon, Walmart, or any third-party marketplace. I have seen cinnamon supplements on those platforms with Ceylon on the label. Some are Cassia. Some are real Ceylon at doses that will not do anything. Buying directly from the official At2a website is the only way to verify you are getting the authenticated formula, the correct species, the stated dose, the MCT oil delivery, and the tested product. When you are taking something every day to manage your blood sugar, the supply chain matters.\\n\\nThe other thing I tell every patient I recommend this to: give it the full three months.\\n\\nHere is why that matters.\\n\\nThe sleep improvement and the energy shift happen fast. Most people notice within the first week. The fasting glucose drop follows in weeks two through four. But the full result, the A1C shift, the sustained metabolic change, the kind of kidney improvement my doctor said was not supposed to happen, that takes the full 8 to 12 weeks. There is no shortcut to that timeline.\\n\\nThis is why At2a sells a three-month supply. Not as a tactic. Because three months is the clinical window. You are not seeing the full result at 30 days.\\n\\nAnd this is why they back it with a 90-day money-back guarantee. Full 90 days. Open the bag, take it every day, see what happens to your fasting glucose, your sleep, your energy, your mental clarity. If your numbers do not move, send back what is left and get every dollar back. The guarantee is long enough to cover the full result window. That is not an accident.\\n\\nOne practical note. Supply turns over faster than you would expect, because most people who try it order the three-month supply. When that is what people are buying, inventory moves quickly. If it is available when you see this, I would not wait.\\n\\nI have recommended this to six patients now. All six have come back and told me the same thing. Better sleep, usually within the first week. Stable energy throughout the day. Lower fasting glucose within the first month. Improved mental clarity.\\n\\nOne of them cried when she told me she had slept through the night for the first time in two years.\\n\\nAnother patient's A1C dropped from 7.4 to 6.1 in three months. Her doctor told her to keep taking whatever she was taking.\\n\\nThat is not a coincidence. That is a pattern.\\n\\nI went from stage 2 kidney disease back to normal function. From a fasting glucose of 187 to 96. From waking up two to three times every night to sleeping through. From that Walmart checkout line, holding something I never imagined I would need at 60, to feeling like I did a decade ago.\\n\\nIf there is even a chance this could work for you the way it worked for me, it is worth 90 days to find out.\\n\\nSandra K., RN, ICU, 38 years\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"http://cc.muvost.com/\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"cc.muvost.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg with MCT Oil | AT2A\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"One softgel a day of genuine Sri Lankan Ceylon cinnamon to support healthy blood sugar.\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":1,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":0,\"duplicates\":null,\"reachDelta1d\":0,\"reachDelta7d\":0,\"reachDelta30d\":0},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":10,\"currentRank\":10,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":66.67},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1832102997875130\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-26T10:33:02.532Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-27T10:30:09.632Z\",\"daysRunning\":1,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/59e33f8ba88881b049b736726422bad2ae0bce7748f71c17fe540dfd0067e09c.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/5d77928300ebaa72cabe8c6134b0b935257ac21a899c7a171177c9c39fe75f20.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1463687556821165\",\"name\":\"Nature's Healing Herbs\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/1463687556821165.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1463687556821165\",\"liveAdsCount\":135,\"reach30d\":13339,\"totalReach\":13339,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":9,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Looking to Support Healthy Blood Sugar Naturally? 🌿\\n\\nExperience the Power of Metabolae Sri Lankan Ceylon Cinnamon!\\n\\n✅ Helps support healthy blood sugar levels\\n✅ Supports steady daily energy\\n✅ Helps reduce blood sugar crashes\\n✅ Authentic Sri Lankan Ceylon cinnamon\\n✅ 200+ Clinical studies\\n✅ Enhanced with MCT oil for absorption\\n\\nSupport healthier glucose metabolism naturally with research-backed ingredients designed for daily stability.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://metabolae.com/products/softgels-ceylon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"metabolae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":null,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":68,\"currentRank\":68,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":50.37},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1495647675834126\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-26T19:11:50.895Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T19:29:52.674Z\",\"daysRunning\":1,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/2eeba5887e3b699c7789745a0981c37072b25c3c959e7afa7bf18b4bc7cc6724.jpg\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1013442788524883\",\"name\":\"Caroline Moore\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1013442788524883.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1013442788524883\",\"liveAdsCount\":3389,\"reach30d\":1144134,\"totalReach\":2517956,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":1884,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"My eGFR came back at 58.\\n\\nI looked at that number and made myself one promise. I wasn't going to ignore it.\\n\\nThis is what happened when I took one 7,200 milligram true Ceylon cinnamon softgel every morning for 30 days.\\n\\nNow, most people get this wrong. They grab cheap, dry cinnamon powder off the shelf, take it for weeks, and wonder why nothing changes, or why they end up with Cassia cinnamon that actually burdens the liver and kidneys.\\n\\nI'm Caroline Moore. I'm not a doctor or a nurse, just someone who refused to sit back when my own kidney numbers started sliding. Here is what I learned, and my exact 30-day journal of what happened when I switched to the real thing.\\n\\nI'll be straight with you. I had no idea what an eGFR even was until my doctor circled it in red at my last checkup.\\n\\n58. The range where doctors start watching you closely. Not yet at the stage where they're talking about dialysis, but close enough that the words kidney disease were sitting in the room with us without being said out loud.\\n\\nMy doctor mentioned it, made some notes, told me to watch my blood pressure, eat less sodium, and come back in six months. That was it. No explanation of what was actually happening inside my kidneys. No conversation about what had pushed my numbers there in the first place. Just watch and wait.\\n\\nI drove home and spent the rest of the afternoon reading everything I could find. Because watching and waiting has never been how I operate.\\n\\nWhat I found was not reassuring. I learned that high blood sugar thickens the blood and forces the kidneys to filter under constant extra load. That high blood pressure pounds against the tiny microscopic filters inside your kidneys with every single heartbeat, thousands of times a day, wearing them down slowly over years. That poor cholesterol and sluggish circulation restrict smooth blood flow to those same filters, compounding the pressure. Your kidneys are downstream from all of it. Everything you let slide eventually reaches them.\\n\\nThat's when I understood why my numbers were sliding. And that's when I stopped waiting.\\n\\nA few months before that appointment, I'd noticed something different about my neighbor Sandra. We'd been trading the same complaints for years: the afternoon crashes, the foggy head that wouldn't clear, the puffy swollen ankles by dinnertime, waking up at two or three in the morning to drag ourselves to the bathroom. It was just life after fifty, we told ourselves.\\n\\nThen one day Sandra just looked lighter. Less puffy around the eyes. She told me she'd been sleeping through the night for the first time in nearly two years.\\n\\nI asked what changed. She told me about a Ceylon cinnamon supplement she'd started taking every morning. Not the grocery-store kind, not the capsules on Amazon. A concentrated version suspended in MCT oil inside a softgel. She had blood sugar swings, borderline blood pressure, the same downstream concerns I'd been collecting for years. And something had clearly shifted.\\n\\nI was skeptical. I'd bought cinnamon capsules before. They did nothing.\\n\\nBut Sandra looked like herself again, and that stuck with me.\\n\\nAfter my doctor's appointment, I went back to what Sandra had been taking and spent two weeks reading everything I could find about Ceylon cinnamon and kidney function. Here is what I found out, and why I had wasted my money every time I'd tried cinnamon before.\\n\\nMost cinnamon supplements sold on Amazon or in health food stores are made from Cassia cinnamon, not Ceylon. Cassia contains coumarin, a compound that stresses the liver and kidneys with extended use. The exact opposite of what you need when your eGFR is already under pressure. Some of the labels say Ceylon. Many of them are not. The labeling on cinnamon supplements is a mess.\\n\\nThe ones that actually are authentic Ceylon are still usually ground powder. And here is the problem. The active compounds in Ceylon cinnamon, the polyphenols and cinnamaldehyde that actually support how your cells respond to insulin and reduce the downstream pressure on your kidneys, are fat-soluble. Dry powder hits stomach acid and breaks apart before it ever reaches your cells. Your body absorbs almost none of it. I'd been taking the right idea and the wrong form.\\n\\nFor it to actually work, it has to be authenticated Cinnamomum verum from Sri Lanka, a concentrated extract rather than raw powder, and it has to be suspended in a fat carrier so the fat-soluble compounds can absorb instead of passing straight through. The brand Sandra mentioned, Metabolae, uses a 12-to-1 concentrated extract. That is 7,200 milligrams of raw Ceylon cinnamon equivalent in a single softgel, delivered in MCT oil so the active compounds reach your cells rather than your toilet.\\n\\nThat is the difference between three weeks of nothing and results you actually feel.\\n\\nDay three, I stopped waking up multiple times in the middle of the night to run to the bathroom. The Ceylon compounds and MCT oil delivery were actually absorbing into my system instead of passing straight through like the cheap powder capsules I had tried before. I'd been up two or three times a night for over a year. The first morning I woke up at six without having moved, I just lay there for a moment not quite believing it.\\n\\nDay ten, the heavy swelling around my ankles by evening started going down. I had gotten so used to that tight, waterlogged feeling in my lower legs by dinnertime that I had stopped noticing it. Then one evening I looked down and it simply wasn't there the same way. The afternoon brain fog and energy crashes that used to knock me sideways weren't hitting the same way either. The 12-to-1 concentrated extract was doing what dry powder never could: actually reaching my cells and easing the daily strain that high blood sugar, high blood pressure, and poor circulation had been placing on my body for years.\\n\\nDay twenty-one, my morning blood pressure, fasting blood sugar, and urine clarity looked steadier than they had in months. The urine foam that had been showing up most mornings had almost completely stopped. I could get through dinner without feeling drained or on edge. Even my cholesterol and circulation felt less sluggish. The numbers I'd been quietly watching and dreading every morning were starting to move in the direction I needed.\\n\\nMy body was remembering how to do what it was always supposed to do.\\n\\nDay thirty, my doctor looked at my latest results and said, whatever you are doing, keep doing it.\\n\\nI'm not making promises about what this will do for your numbers. I'm not a doctor, and your kidneys are your own. What I can tell you is that for the first time in over a year I am sleeping through the night, my ankles are not swollen by evening, and the results that sent me down this path have moved in the right direction.\\n\\nI tried three cheaper brands before finding Metabolae. Weeks of nothing, twice over. If you are going to try this, don't waste your time on grocery-store cinnamon powder or generic capsules. The species matters. The concentration matters. The delivery system matters. Without MCT oil, the active compounds don't absorb. That's not an opinion. That's the biochemistry.\\n\\nOne softgel every morning. That's it.\\n\\nThey back it with a full 90-day money-back guarantee. If your numbers don't move in 90 days, you send back what's left of the bag and get every dollar back. No conditions, no interrogation. I didn't even know that when I ordered my first bag. I wish I had. It would have saved me the weeks I wasted on brands that never had a chance of working.\\n\\nThe window to protect your kidney function is still open. The earlier you act, the more you have to work with.\\n\\nLink is below.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://metabolae.com/pages/lp-ceylon-cinnamon-insulin-1\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"metabolae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Supports healthy blood sugar levels and metabolism with premium Ceylon cinnamon. Shop Metabolae's science-backed supplements. Free shipping available.\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":null,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":2257,\"currentRank\":2257,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":66.6},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1676590304260247\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-26T10:45:10.557Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T10:45:25.773Z\",\"daysRunning\":1,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/a971377a4d9a0e9c4f16200703c73aa2909219222263b9111a66efa55ac6e908.png\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"108913412309882\",\"name\":\"Nowell Lawson Zach\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/108913412309882.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"108913412309882\",\"liveAdsCount\":18,\"reach30d\":2,\"totalReach\":1574,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":31,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"You've spent more on cinnamon pills that did nothing than this sale would ever cost you. Three bottles with zero results. Two that gave you stomach burn. One you retu