Id\":\"1106647162524028\",\"liveAdsCount\":4312,\"reach30d\":1892898,\"totalReach\":3974228,\"countriesCount\":4,\"facebookLikes\":7770,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Looking to Support Healthy Blood Sugar Naturally? 🌿\\n\\nExperience the Power of Metabolae Sri Lankan Ceylon Cinnamon!\\n\\n✅ Helps support healthy blood sugar levels\\n✅ Supports steady daily energy\\n✅ Helps reduce blood sugar crashes\\n✅ Authentic Sri Lankan Ceylon cinnamon\\n✅ 200+ Clinical studies\\n✅ Enhanced with MCT oil for absorption\\n\\nSupport healthier glucose metabolism naturally with research-backed ingredients designed for daily stability.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://metabolae.com/products/softgels-ceylon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"metabolae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":15931,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":143,\"duplicates\":22,\"reachDelta1d\":387,\"reachDelta7d\":1293,\"reachDelta30d\":10345},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":380,\"currentRank\":380,\"rankDelta\":-19,\"improvementPct\":8.81},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_2416912332468683\",\"collationId\":\"1608832437655253\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-05T22:33:57.038Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-04T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-07T01:21:21.175Z\",\"daysRunning\":23,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/b75309866bc10477289f7e535eea61c298662459390aa2f4a3d547caa1ddd33b.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/88d1431ccbb2dbb5a7d58c5d47f28158f029c6c09bde76921fd858a12663b3b0.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1320220534499362\",\"name\":\"Cristian - Co-Founder, Metabolae\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/1320220534499362.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1320220534499362\",\"liveAdsCount\":679,\"reach30d\":410049,\"totalReach\":778720,\"countriesCount\":4,\"facebookLikes\":1946,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"The number one thing that almost stopped people ordering was the price.\\n⠀\\nWe know because we ask. After every purchase, a few short questions pop up on the thank-you page, and price is the answer we see more than any other.\\n⠀\\nWe understand why. A lot of the people answering already pay for two or three prescriptions every month, so one more pouch can feel like one more bill.\\n⠀\\nSo we sat down and worked it out the way they would.\\n⠀\\nThe five-pouch bundle is $89.99. Each pouch holds 30 softgels, and you take one a day. That's 150 days, about five months, for roughly 60 cents a day.\\n⠀\\nThat's less than a drive-thru coffee, the kind most of us buy without thinking twice.\\n⠀\\nHere's what those 60 cents pay for. Real Ceylon cinnamon from Sri Lanka, not the cassia sold in grocery store jars. Clinically dosed, so the whole amount is in one softgel. And already dissolved in MCT oil, so your body actually takes it in.\\n⠀\\nNothing comes off the plate and nothing comes out of the routine. One softgel goes in with breakfast, and that's the whole change.\\n⠀\\nEnergy tends to come back first, usually within the first few weeks. The numbers move slower, so we tell people to give it two months before they judge it.\\n⠀\\nThere's a 90-day money-back guarantee on every order. That's longer than the two months we just asked you to give it.\\n⠀\\nRight now the five-pouch bundle is up to 70% off, which is where the 60 cents comes from. It won't stay that low.\\n⠀\\nTap the link below.\\n⠀\\n~ The Metabolae team\\n⠀\\nP.S. 60 cents a day works out to about $18 a month.\",\"transcript\":\"on the five pack, it's 60 cents a day. Five pouches, one soft gel a day. That's five whole months for under $90. And it's real Ceylon from Sri Lanka. It's clinically dosed, and it's already dissolved in oil, so your body actually takes it in. Your coffee stays, your dinner stays. You just add one soft gel at breakfast. Your energy comes back first, about two to four weeks in. Then the numbers start moving, and you've got 90 days, or your money back. Right now, the five pack is 70% off, and that won't last. Five months from now, you've either finished all five pouches, or you're still crashing after every meal. Tap shop now.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://metabolae.com/products/softgels-ceylon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"metabolae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":11184,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":101,\"duplicates\":21,\"reachDelta1d\":110,\"reachDelta7d\":4165,\"reachDelta30d\":10484},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":55,\"currentRank\":55,\"rankDelta\":-3,\"improvementPct\":8.1},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}}],\"pagination\":{\"page\":2,\"limit\":4,\"total\":5423,\"totalPages\":1356,\"offset\":4,\"isTotalApproximate\":false},\"meta\":{\"query\":\"metabolae.com\",\"keywords\":[],\"searchIn\":\"domain\",\"categoryIds\":[],\"country\":null,\"countryFilterKind\":\"audienceCountry\",\"adCountries\":null,\"mainCountries\":[],\"trendSignal\":\"reach_growth_7d\",\"sortBy\":\"mostDuplicates\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"requestedLimit\":4,\"effectiveLimit\":4,\"activeOnly\":true,\"status\":\"all\",\"page\":2,\"minTrafficGrowthPercent\":null,\"trafficGrowthPeriod\":\"last30d\",\"trafficGrowth\":null,\"adsGrowth\":null,\"pageReachGrowth\"