{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018DAyWJvWGxKSk12KpR45Fc","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"9c6e4876-1e1e-41a9-aa94-b49642c891a1\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1449131290027953\",\"collationId\":\"1148697797888328\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-17T17:23:44.454Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-17T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T18:07:08.435Z\",\"daysRunning\":10,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/8396e64257b00307591c89175f755f8d04b384d7897401c3e30df686078073b8.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/d615278a2ecb91769d5e7418800232c5d8d2d90152f0481b1d3be2e62fb7fc34.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"169830089763759\",\"name\":\"Le Chercheur D'amour\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/169830089763759.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"169830089763759\",\"liveAdsCount\":1303,\"reach30d\":343865,\"totalReach\":427078,\"countriesCount\":2,\"facebookLikes\":314,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Looking to Support Healthy Blood Sugar Naturally? 🌿\\nExperience the Power of Primal Remedies Ceylon Cinnamon!\\n \\n✅ Helps support healthy blood sugar levels\\n✅ Supports steady daily energy & reduces crashes\\n✅ Enhanced with MCT oil for optimal absorption\\n✅ Authentic Ceylon cinnamon (concentrated 7,200 mg equivalent)\\n✅ Clean, research-backed ingredients for daily metabolic balance\\n \\nSupport healthier glucose levels naturally with a pure, high-potency formula built for daily stability.\",\"transcript\":\"Taking cinnamon for blood sugar support? The type matters. Does Ceylon cinnamon help support healthy blood sugar? Yes. Does it help with burning or tingling in your feet? Yes. Kidney health? Yes. Vision? Yes. Energy crashes? Yes. Circulation? Yes. Brain fog? Yes. Weight? Yes. Okay, wait. Is there anything it cannot do? Honestly, not much. Look, people ask me this all the time, and here is what I tell them. Ceylon cinnamon has been used for thousands of years, long before any of us had a name for what it was doing. But what makes it special is one compound, cinnamaldehyde. That is the active compound inside true Ceylon cinnamon. That is what supports blood sugar. That is what helps calm the burning in your feet. That is what supports your kidneys, your circulation, your energy. So why isn't everyone just taking cinnamon then? Because most people are not taking Ceylon cinnamon. They are taking cassia bark, a completely different plant. It contains zero cinnamaldehyde. That's why it does nothing. So what do you actually recommend? True Ceylon cinnamon from Sri Lanka, concentrated and suspended in MCT oil so your body actually absorbs it. The only brand that I recommend that fills the right requirements is Primal Remedies, 7,200 milligram equivalent per soft gel, one a day. That's it. If I could get this into the hands of everyone asking me about their blood sugar or their feet or their energy, I would. Where do people get it? The link is right below this video. They have a 90-day money-back guarantee, so there is zero risk. But stock has been running low, so do not wait on it.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://primal-remedies.com/pages/ceylon-cinnamon-7200mg-b-kid\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"primal-remedies.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Buy 2 Get 1 Free\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":8496,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":76,\"duplicates\":4,\"reachDelta1d\":1148,\"reachDelta7d\":6373,\"reachDelta30d\":8369},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":8,\"currentRank\":8,\"rankDelta\":-3,\"improvementPct\":0.61},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_946888944768303\",\"collationId\":\"1421680476176665\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-12T04:57:40.376Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-10-11T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-07T05:42:55.017Z\",\"daysRunning\":47,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/8c88e4c3274e1caa51209cf575909f2c7778777ad7981de200017e66a384ec6a.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/98e966be5a27bc5397c999dd1b115bd9df4b0f00758781fd8b1d40951e5326cb.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"100217532825885\",\"name\":\"Blood Sugar Diary\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/100217532825885.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"100217532825885\",\"liveAdsCount\":250,\"reach30d\":345247,\"totalReach\":439746,\"countriesCount\":2,\"facebookLikes\":353,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"🩸 Lower Your Blood Sugar Naturally — No Extra Meds, No Crashes\\n✅ Supports healthy fasting glucose & A1C levels \\n⚡ Kills the afternoon energy crash with clean, steady fuel \\n🔬 12x more potent than standard cinnamon capsules \\n💧 MCT Oil makes sure your body actually absorbs it — not just passes it \\n🌿 True Ceylon cinnamon — safe for daily long-term use \\n \\n👉 Try Primal Remedies today — and give your doctor something to smile about.\\nhttps://primal-remedies.com/pages/ceylon-cinnamon-7200mg-b-kid\",\"transcript\":\"If somebody whose blood sugar is making them pee three times a night took this blood sugar formula for 30 days, here's what would happen. Within the first 24 hours, the true silent cinnamon sourced from Sri Lanka lowers the blood sugar that's flushing the water out of your body, so you stop waking up three times a night to piss. After three days, you notice it stops your blood sugar from crashing, so your body stops chasing bread and sweets to bring it back up. And after seven days, cinnamalahide, the primary compound in silent cinnamon, slows the sugar hitting your blood after every meal. But what happens is what's worth it. You feel more energy. You start sleeping through the night. You have more peace of mind as your A1C levels start getting into normal range. After 14 days, lunch stops knocking you out cold on the couch. That's because the silent cinnamon stops the sugar surge that makes you tired as hell, so you can actually get done what you needed to do that same afternoon. After 17 and a half days, you notice that in the middle of day, you don't have that swollen feeling in your lower body like your feet, ankles, and legs. That's the blood sugar finally getting managed as it clears the sugar choking your body into inflammation. And after 30 days, all of that trapped sugar in your blood is moving into your cells the way it's supposed to. That A1C that was climbing up during every visit is finally heading down. Even your significant other notices your increased mood because you're sleeping normally again and you have more energy. But here's the thing. Real silent cinnamon only works if it's verified. Primal remedies that real verified silent cinnamon. It's sourced from Sri Lanka to ensure it contains cinnamaldehyde, which is the primary compound. And that's based on how it's harvested. It's third-party tested, completely cummeran-free, and suspended in MCT oil so it allows for maximum cellular absorption in the body. Unlike all of the fake silent cinnamon out there. Watch what really happens when you get your blood sugar under control so you can get your life back and stop having to worry. For a limited time, there is a special sale for silent cinnamon. And just remember to get the right kind, so go check out our Primal Remedy silent cinnamon in the link below.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://primal-remedies.com/pages/ceylon-cinnamon-7200mg-b-kid\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"primal-remedies.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"90-Day Risk-Free Guarantee\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":107266,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":965,\"duplicates\":4,\"reachDelta1d\":2751,\"reachDelta7d\":5580,\"reachDelta30d\":77151},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":5,\"currentRank\":5,\"rankDelta\":4,\"improvementPct\":2},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1678765693968081\",\"collationId\":\"1394249542528302\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-11T06:29:15.300Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-10T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-14T14:53:07.630Z\",\"daysRunning\":17,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/a3b8f47891f6b1cd3c097a0508234d70598bc764af966d4c8b022891d42fcb69.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/60848af6c9de3deb829e87444462bff063727155286a40783581d5ef2e986f5b.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"100217532825885\",\"name\":\"Blood Sugar Diary\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/100217532825885.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"100217532825885\",\"liveAdsCount\":250,\"reach30d\":345247,\"totalReach\":439746,\"countriesCount\":2,\"facebookLikes\":353,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Been told type 2 diabetes is just about sugar and getting older? There's more to the story.\\n\\nHigh blood sugar over the years affects more than the number on your meter. It reaches the tiny blood vessels that feed your eyes, kidneys, feet and nerves.\\n\\nThat's why we made Primal Remedies Ceylon Cinnamon:\\n✔️ True Ceylon, not the cassia most supplements use\\n✔️ Fat-soluble compounds like cinnamaldehyde, delivered in organic MCT oil so they have a carrier\\n✔️ A 7,200 mg equivalent dose\\n\\n🌿 True Ceylon, not cheap cassia\\n🥥 Organic MCT oil delivery\\n✅ Third-party tested in the USA\\n🛡️ 90-day money-back guarantee\\n\\nTap \\\"Learn More\\\" to see the formula.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://primal-remedies.com/pages/adv32-managed-universal\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"primal-remedies.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"How to Take True Ceylon Cinnamon the Right Way\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":15324,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":138,\"duplicates\":8,\"reachDelta1d\":1279,\"reachDelta7d\":5431,\"reachDelta30d\":15321},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":4,\"currentRank\":4,\"rankDelta\":1,\"improvementPct\":1.6},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}}],\"pagination\":{\"page\":2,\"limit\":3,\"total\":1620,\"totalPages\":540,\"offset\":3,\"isTotalApproximate\":false},\"meta\":{\"query\":\"primal-remedies.com\",\"keywords\":[],\"searchIn\":\"domain\",\"categoryIds\":[],\"country\":null,\"countryFilterKind\":\"audienceCountry\",\"adCountries\":null,\"mainCountries\":[],\"trendSignal\":\"reach_growth_7d\",\"sortBy\":\"reachDelta7d\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"requestedLimit\":3,\"effectiveLimit\":3,\"activeOnly\":true,\"status\":\"active\",\"page\":2,\"minTrafficGrowthPercent\":null,\"trafficGrowthPeriod\":\"last30d\",\"trafficGrowth\":null,\"adsGrowth\":null,\"pageReachGrowth\":null,\"adReachGrowth\":null,\"language\":null,\"adLanguages\":[],\"cta\":[],\"currency\":null,\"currencies\":[],\"shopifyAppIds\":[],\"excludeShopifyAppIds\":[],\"pixelIds\":[],\"excludePixelIds\":[],\"themeIds\":[],\"filters\":{\"search\":[\"primal-remedies.com\"],\"searchType\":\"domain\",\"keywordMode\":\"any\",\"sortBy\":\"reachDelta7d\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"page\":2,\"limit\":3,\"platforms\":[\"facebook\"],\"status\":\"active\"},\"warnings\":[],\"paginationMaxOffset\":10000},\"fieldGuide\":{\"count