{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01418jufkTqb1xCReJhrCFne","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"018cc39b-0ab7-4549-ba6e-fffc5170689f\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1763419348115477\",\"collationId\":\"1581740910311268\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-12T03:26:27.376Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-11T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-29T01:26:44.563Z\",\"daysRunning\":77,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/a17e2a97a8df448a2fc78f741def87b5710d8f60374fa8e44edd6a1ddd0f997f.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/76701e99ec22b7ff32e518cf034f9dbc09a93923a79a0d5dd73133d6029ea9f8.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1106647162524028\",\"name\":\"Blood Sugar Balance Community\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1106647162524028.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1106647162524028\",\"liveAdsCount\":4312,\"reach30d\":1892898,\"totalReach\":3974228,\"countriesCount\":5,\"facebookLikes\":7770,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"If your A1C is managed and there is still foam in your toilet every morning, your kidneys are telling you something your doctor is not. I'm Sandra Keller. Nephrology nurse. 22 years.\\n\\nI have been a nephrology nurse for 22 years. I have watched blood sugar dissolve kidneys from the inside out. I have sat beside patients and explained what dialysis means. I have watched people lose toes to neuropathy. I have watched someone go blind from complications.\\n\\nSo when a patient came to my clinic six months ago, type 2 for eleven years, A1C sitting at 6.8, on Metformin and a blood pressure pill, following every instruction, and his protein spillage had climbed to 510 while his feet had started tingling, I sat down and told him the truth. His numbers were managed. His kidneys were not.\\n\\nThree months later he came back. GFR 51. Protein spillage dropped to 280. Fasting glucose from 138 to 104. Neuropathy almost gone. I looked at his chart. \\\"What did you change?\\\" He reached into his jacket and set a bag on my desk. Ceylon cinnamon. Concentrated extract. 7,200mg in MCT oil. Metabolae.\\n\\nThat night I could not stop thinking about the GFR. GFR does not move like that. Not in three months. Not in a patient declining for two years. At 11:30 PM I started reading.\\n\\nYour A1C measures how much sugar is floating in your blood. That is all it measures. It does not see the tiny capillaries threading through your kidney tissue. It does not see the nerves in your feet. A 6.8 can be managed and your kidney filters can still be quietly wearing down behind it.\\n\\nThe tiny filters inside your kidneys have been under sustained pressure from glucose for years. They start to fail. Protein leaks out. Your feet start to burn. The damage that leads to dialysis is already happening while your doctor says managed. That neuropathy is not a warning sign. It is evidence that kidney failure is already happening.\\n\\nEvery cell has doors. GLUT4 transporters. Insulin gives the signal, they open, sugar moves into the cell. In insulin resistance, those doors stop responding. The sugar stays in your blood. Keeps grinding through every small vessel. Kidney capillaries. Nerves in your feet. Year after year.\\n\\nMetformin tells your liver to produce less sugar. It reduces the flood. But it does not touch the doors. The sugar that remains keeps grinding. The drug that reduced the flood did not open the drain.\\n\\nThere is a compound that triggers the doors directly. MHCP. Found in true Ceylon cinnamon. Not cassia. When the doors open, glucose clears from the blood. The pressure on the kidney filters drops. The neuropathy pain lessens. The protein spillage drops. The drain opens. Your medications manage the flood. This opens the drain. Both together is the full answer.\\n\\nBut most cinnamon products are cassia. Wrong plant. Cassia burdens your liver at therapeutic doses. And even real Ceylon in a dry capsule does not absorb. The active compounds are fat-soluble. Without oil, they pass straight through. Your cinnamon did not fail because cinnamon does not work. It failed because it was never delivered.\\n\\nMetabolae. True Ceylon. DNA-verified from Sri Lanka. 7,200mg. 12 to 1 concentrated extract. Suspended in MCT oil. Third-party tested. The same bag that patient set on my desk.\\n\\nI went home and ordered a bag. Week 2, my fasting glucose dropped from 112 to 98. Week 3, the 3 AM trips stopped. Sleeping through the night for the first time in a year. Week 10, my creatinine came back at 1.0. It was 1.3 six months earlier. My colleague looked at it. \\\"What did you change?\\\" \\\"Keep doing whatever you're doing.\\\"\\n\\nThat patient came back. GFR 54. Up from 46. Protein spillage 195. Down from 510. Tingling gone. He smiled. \\\"The drain opened.\\\" I have recommended Metabolae to nine patients. Every single one. Same pattern. One woman, 61, spillage down 40 percent. She cried when the foam was gone. Another patient's GFR went from 51 to 57. His nephrologist said the trajectory had changed.\\n\\nIf you are sitting with a managed A1C while your kidney markers decline. While the foam is still there. While your feet still tingle. While the fear of dialysis grows bigger every year. Try Metabolae risk-free. 90-day guarantee. If your numbers do not move, you pay nothing. One softgel daily with breakfast. The flood is being managed. The drain was never opened. You know now that it can be. Tap below.\",\"transcript\":\"Ray, wake up. I need you to drive me to the hospital now. What, Sandra? Is it indigestion again? No. It's central pressure radiating to my jaw. I'm losing my breath. This is the exact situation I've been describing to patients for the last twenty years. We're going. Get dressed right now. I never thought I'd be the one placing a stent in a cardiologist, especially not the one who personally trained me. Let's get this done. I don't want to end up like my father. He was type two two. Died from a heart attack at 64. Yes, ma'am. Don't worry. Everything's going to be fine. Sandra, I don't have good news. Go ahead. Your eGFR dropped from 89 to 71. I'm afraid it's early stage two diabetic nephropathy. How? I mean, nobody flagged it. Your A1C has always been managed. The algorithm didn't trigger a referral. So that's five organs now. Specialist found small hemorrhages in both eyes. Early background retinopathy. The hepatologist ordered a liver ultrasound. Grade two hepatic steatosis. Podiatry found measurable peripheral neuropathy in both feet, right worse than left. And now, early stage two diabetic nephropathy. I'm sorry. Priyanka, your a one c was 7.8. Now it's 5.6. You came off lisinopril twenty months ago. What are you doing? Doctor, I didn't think you'd take it seriously. Try me. My aunt Kumardy, she's from New Jersey. She's been telling us about this thing for years. Telling you what? Just go see her, please. This is an address? She knows things modern medicine hasn't told us. I'll go this Saturday. Your medications are fighting the wrong battle. You know this. That's why you're sitting at my kitchen table. I read the mechanism studies just before coming here. Now I understand it clinically. This one is your feet. This one is your kidneys. This one is your eyes. This one is your liver. And this one is your heart. Your specialist told you that you have five different problems. When in reality, it's one problem. The same trapped sugar grinding through all five organs. The metformin quieted my glucose number. Lisinopril lowered my pressure. The statin reduced my LDL. But exactly. Three numbers on three chart lines. Below all three, the trapped sugar's been grinding through your vessels every heartbeat year after year. Now here's what nobody taught you in medical school. For over one thousand years, the women in my grandmother's village have been using one thing for this: true Ceylon cinnamon, not Cassia. Cassia is a different plant, cheaper from China, and it has two fifty times more coumarin, which strains your liver. What does real Ceylon do? It has two compounds. One is called MHCP. It opens the cellular doors. Your training says are managed by insulin. Once the doors open, the trapped sugar finally moves out of your bloodstream and grinding stops. The second compound is cinnamaldehyde. It repairs blood vessels that the trapped sugar damaged. The vessels feeding your feet, kidneys, eyes, liver, heart, the arteries your fellow place stents in.: I see. I'll just get it from Amazon then.: Don't. Most of the stuff there isn't real Ceylon cinnamon. It has to be the right species, clinically dosed and suspended in oil. Without oil, most of what you swallow passes through and never absorbs. In Sri Lanka, we eat cinnamon with coconut. That's why our women live into their 90s without heart disease. Here. This is the only one I trust. If you don't want to grow your own saline cinnamon like me. Metabolet? Try one soft gel every morning with breakfast for ninety days, then watch what happens. Oh, Doc, one more thing. There's a lot of research on MHCP and Ceylon cinnamon. Look it up yourself when you get home. I will. Thank you for everything. Sandra, what did you do? I know. I haven't seen a reversal like this in twenty two years of cardiology practice. My energy's back. My vision's sharper. The burning in my feet stopped. I ate rice for the first time in six years yesterday with Ray. And as you can see, my numbers shifted too. I mean, this is unheard of. Your a one c is 5.4, Fasting glucose 87. LDL 74. EGFR climbed to 83. Creatinine back to 0.9. Blood pressure one fifteen over 72. Exactly. I don't need the stents anymore. I almost waited too long. Don't make the same mistake. Fix the trapped sugar in your blood. Don't just focus on chart numbers. Metabolet is running a sale right now. Get two plus one completely free. You're covered by a ninety day money back guarantee, so you have nothing to lose. But your loved ones can potentially lose you if you keep waiting. Don't let that happen. The link is below for you to check it out. I hope you see the same reversal I did.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://metabolae.com/products/softgels-ceylon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"metabolae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":204098,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":1837,\"duplicates\":20,\"reachDelta1d\":5882,\"reachDelta7d\":8164,\"reachDelta30d\":16125},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":120,\"currentRank\":120,\"rankDelta\":-11,\"improvementPct\":2.78},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1390947879097942\",\"collationId\":\"877596041951614\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-03T09:33:47.464Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-02T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-08T09:02:30.535Z\",\"daysRunning\":86,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/0747da8321183684cd086eecc534508e851417e1373fdd0414fb2bc3e5155dcf.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/2baea7ee7ca3094df18b6f29627cf7c7e4a1b1080b7bde6df67262fbc9b12621.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"958558520684789\",\"name\":\"John Tucker\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/958558520684789.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"958558520684789\",\"liveAdsCount\":1333,\"reach30d\":492752,\"totalReach\":1373110,\"countriesCount\":5,\"facebookLikes\":4388,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"What happens when you take Metabolae every single day for 90 days? You pop the softgel and the liquid goes straight to your cells.\\nWithin hours, your cell’s mechanism that turns sugar into energy, which are called GLUT4 transporters, start waking up.\\nOn day 7, you wake up energized in the morning because you slept through the night. \\nSince you have less sugar roaming around in your bloodstream, you don’t feel the need to pee at midnight.\\nNo midnight bathroom trips and no soaked sheets from night sweats.\\nWithin two weeks, you might be surprised at your fasting glucose levels.\\nPeople who have been stuck in the 140’s for months see a big reduction. Up to 29% less fasting blood sugar. \\nYou might test again to make sure the meter isn't broken.\\nFirst month.\\nThe nerve pain in your legs and feet is reduced.\\nMost people report having less of it. It’s reduced enough to keep wearing socks and covering your feet with bed sheets.\\nThat’s because blood sugar isn’t making the nerve pain worse.\\nDay 45.\\nYou look in the toilet and see your pee isn’t foamy. \\nThe protein spillage is dropping because your kidneys aren’t overwhelmed clearing all that blood sugar.\\nThey are catching their breath.\\nBy this point, many people see improved creatinine and GFR markers.\\nDay 60.\\nSymptoms from high blood sugar and kidney issues are almost gone.\\nYou no longer feel foggy throughout the day and you can focus better. \\nYour energy remains stable, without relying on caffeine.\\nThat’s because glucose is finally getting INTO your cells... instead of just circulating in your blood.\\nDay 75.\\nYou go back for labs.\\nYou see a couple points higher in your GFR score. \\nYour doctor stares at the screen, pulls up your old results, and gives you a puzzled look, asking what changed.\\n\\\"What changed?\\\"\\nNinety days in.\\nYou walk into your nephrologist's office.\\nThey pull up your labs.\\nGFR is better by 10 points.\\nProtein spillage is down up to 40%.\\nAnd creatinine levels dropped by up to 0.7 points.\\nThe doctor leans back in their chair.\\n\\\"We were preparing to have the dialysis conversation.\\\"\\n\\\"We're not having it today.\\\"\\n\\\"Your kidney function is improving.\\\"\\nJust one softgel a day for 90 days.\\nYour numbers moved in the direction they haven't moved in years.\\nThis is what happens when you take Metabolae Ceylon cinnamon extract, dosed at 7,200mg, for just 90 days…\\nAnd you allow your cells to pull glucose OUT of your blood and INTO your cells.\\nEach pack comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee.\\nThey’re 70% OFF now by clicking the link below.\",\"transcript\":\"If you have high blood sugar, watch what happens when you take metabolite for 90 days. Day one, you pop the soft gel and the liquid goes straight to your cells. Within hours, your cell's mechanism that turns sugar into energy, which are called GLUT4 transporters, start waking up. On day seven, you wake up energized in the morning because you slept through the night. Since you have less sugar roaming around in your bloodstream, you don't feel the need to pee at midnight, no midnight bathroom trips, and no soaked sheets from night sweats. Within two weeks, you might be surprised at your fasting glucose levels. People who have been stuck in the 140s for months see a big reduction, up to 29% less fasting blood sugar. You might test again to make sure the meter isn't broken. First month, the nerve pain in your legs and feet is reduced. Most people report having less of it. It's reduced enough to keep wearing socks and covering your feet with bed sheets. That's because blood sugar isn't making the nerve pain worse. Day 45, you look in the toilet and see your pee isn't foamy. The protein spillage is dropping because your kidneys aren't overwhelmed clearing all that blood sugar. They are catching their breath. By this point, many people see improved creatinine and GFR markers. Day 60, symptoms from high blood sugar and kidney issues are almost gone. You no longer feel foggy throughout the day, and you can focus better. Your energy remains stable without relying on caffeine. That's because glucose is finally getting into your cells instead of just circulating in your blood. Day 75, you go back for labs. You see a couple points higher in your GFR score. Your doctor stares at the screen, pulls up your old results, and gives you a puzzled look, asking what changed. What changed? 90 days in, you walk into your nephrologist's office. They pull up your labs. GFR is better by 10 points. Protein spillage is down up to 40%, and creatinine levels dropped by up to 0.7 points. The doctor leans back in their chair. We were preparing to have the dialysis conversation. We're not having it today. Your kidney function is improving. Just one soft gel a day for 90 days. Your numbers moved in the direction they haven't moved in years. This is what happens when you take Metabolize Salon Cinnamon Extract, dosed at 7,200 milligrams for just 90 days. And you allow your cells to pull glucose out of your blood and into your cells. Each pack comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee. They're 70% off now by clicking the link below.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://metabolae.com/products/softgels-ceylon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"metabolae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":203100,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":1828,\"duplicates\":23,\"reachDelta1d\":658,\"reachDelta7d\":3507,\"reachDelta30d\":28676},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":19,\"currentRank\":19,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":1.43},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1785578349426054\",\"collationId\":\"1367408581734416\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-30T01:24:07.458Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-08-29T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-30T14:24:22.130Z\",\"daysRunning\":90,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/fc3c829559a1c02483a5e3d384cd99275f4e8ad5fc992a29972e2c4067c78de8.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/7bc951779730f3a715a950e89bb799fa3082b987d82e28d3610d0d7e3337e361.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1013442788524883\",\"name\":\"Caroline Moore\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1013442788524883.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1013442788524883\",\"liveAdsCount\":3389,\"reach30d\":1144134,\"totalReach\":2517956,\"countriesCount\":5,\"facebookLikes\":1884,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Looking to Support Healthy Blood Sugar Naturally? 🌿\\n\\nExperience the Power of Metabolae Sri Lankan Ceylon Cinnamon!\\n\\n✅ Helps support healthy blood sugar levels\\n✅ Supports steady daily energy\\n✅ Helps reduce blood sugar crashes\\n✅ Authentic Sri Lankan Ceylon cinnamon\\n✅ 200+ Clinical studies\\n✅ Enhanced with MCT oil for absorption\\n\\nSupport healthier glucose metabolism naturally with research-backed ingredients designed for daily stability.\",\"transcript\":\"Three bags of Metabolé for the price of just one, and here's how to get it today. Only tap that link below to unlock a special flash sale price. Choose the 2 plus 1 free option and get free shipping. But you do have to hurry. This flash deal ends tonight.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://metabolae.com/products/softgels-ceylon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"metabolae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":193954,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":1746,\"duplicates\":4,\"reachDelta1d\":2209,\"reachDelta7d\":15887,\"reachDelta30d\":53273},\"audience\":{\"t