izza, fries, and pudding, that doesn't make sense. What\"},{\"start\":49.275,\"end\":50.075,\"text\":\"are you doing?\"},{\"start\":51.515,\"end\":52.875,\"text\":\"Checking your wristband.\"},{\"start\":53.115,\"end\":54.715,\"text\":\"You think I'm somebody else?\"},{\"start\":55.195,\"end\":56.555,\"text\":\"I think something doesn't add up.\"},{\"start\":58.37,\"end\":59.57,\"text\":\"Linda Carter?\"},{\"start\":59.81,\"end\":63.41,\"text\":\"That's me. She thinks I switched rooms with somebody.\"},{\"start\":64.37,\"end\":65.33,\"text\":\"Let's check it again.\"},{\"start\":70.145,\"end\":71.424995,\"text\":\"01/21.\"},{\"start\":73.185,\"end\":75.34499,\"text\":\"Three days ago, you were over 400.\"},{\"start\":78.064995,\"end\":80.384995,\"text\":\"Your blood sugar came in at four twelve.\"},{\"start\":80.545,\"end\":82.384995,\"text\":\"Your a one c is 11.2.\"},{\"start\":84.96999,\"end\":86.329994,\"text\":\"That's not possible.\"},{\"start\":88.17,\"end\":90.409996,\"text\":\"I take my metformin every day.\"},{\"start\":90.89,\"end\":94.649994,\"text\":\"Six years. I haven't missed a dose. This has been building for a long time.\"},{\"start\":96.065,\"end\":97.985,\"text\":\"My doctor says I'm managed.\"},{\"start\":99.185005,\"end\":101.505005,\"text\":\"Nothing by mouth until we get you stabilized,\"},{\"start\":101.505005,\"end\":103.345,\"text\":\"then we'll talk about starting insulin.\"},{\"start\":104.545006,\"end\":105.425,\"text\":\"Insulin?\"},{\"start\":106.465004,\"end\":107.905,\"text\":\"Let's get you through tonight first.\"},{\"start\":113.27,\"end\":114.63,\"text\":\"04:12.\"},{\"start\":117.03,\"end\":121.59,\"text\":\"I'm sorry. I didn't mean to wake you. You didn't. Hospitals don't let anyone sleep.\"},{\"start\":121.67,\"end\":123.189995,\"text\":\"I heard him say met for men.\"},{\"start\":124.175,\"end\":125.055,\"text\":\"Six years.\"},{\"start\":125.935005,\"end\":128.73502,\"text\":\"I did everything he told me. I know you did.\"},{\"start\":129.295,\"end\":132.09502,\"text\":\"I prescribed metformin for thirty four years.\"},{\"start\":133.295,\"end\":135.695,\"text\":\"You're a doctor? Endocrinologist.\"},{\"start\":135.95,\"end\":136.75,\"text\":\"Retired.\"},{\"start\":136.75,\"end\":143.79001,\"text\":\"I told thousands of women exactly what your doctor told you. Cut the carbs, take the pill, you're managed. And it didn't work for them either?\"},{\"start\":144.03,\"end\":145.31,\"text\":\"Not for most of them.\"},{\"start\":145.70999,\"end\":149.38501,\"text\":\"I watched them lose feeling in their feet, lose their kidneys.\"},{\"start\":149.625,\"end\":152.18501,\"text\":\"I adjusted doses and called it care.\"},{\"start\":152.585,\"end\":159.22502,\"text\":\"I never once told them why the number wouldn't come down because nobody ever taught me. Then how do you know now?\"},{\"start\":159.705,\"end\":161.46501,\"text\":\"Because at 70, it happened to me.\"},{\"start\":162.2,\"end\":164.28,\"text\":\"My a one c hit 8.1\"},{\"start\":164.28,\"end\":165.88,\"text\":\"on my own protocol.\"},{\"start\":166.59999,\"end\":171.56,\"text\":\"And a young Sri Lankan fellow I'd trained sat me down and embarrassed me in my own office.\"},{\"start\":171.79999,\"end\":173.56,\"text\":\"What did he tell you?\"},{\"start\":174.28,\"end\":177.23999,\"text\":\"That I had been treating the wrong thing for thirty four years.\"},{\"start\":178.495,\"end\":180.65501,\"text\":\"Every cell in your body has doors.\"},{\"start\":181.295,\"end\":182.57501,\"text\":\"Insulin knocks,\"},{\"start\":182.655,\"end\":185.37502,\"text\":\"the doors open, the sugar leaves your blood.\"},{\"start\":186.175,\"end\":187.535,\"text\":\"After enough years,\"},{\"start\":187.695,\"end\":189.29501,\"text\":\"those doors stop answering.\"},{\"start\":189.775,\"end\":193.215,\"text\":\"The insulin is there, the sugar is there, nothing opens.\"},{\"start\":193.68,\"end\":198.48,\"text\":\"So the sugar stays in my blood, trapped, moving with every heartbeat,\"},{\"start\":198.48,\"end\":200.8,\"text\":\"grinding through the vessels in your feet first.\"},{\"start\":200.95999,\"end\":202.24,\"text\":\"Do they burn at night?\"},{\"start\":203.04,\"end\":203.92,\"text\":\"For two years?\"},{\"start\":204.56,\"end\":205.43999,\"text\":\"Then your kidneys,\"},{\"start\":206.015,\"end\":207.05501,\"text\":\"your eyes,\"},{\"start\":207.295,\"end\":208.255,\"text\":\"your heart,\"},{\"start\":208.735,\"end\":211.535,\"text\":\"and the metformin I prescribed for thirty four years,\"},{\"start\":212.015,\"end\":214.41501,\"text\":\"it tells the liver to make less new sugar.\"},{\"start\":214.815,\"end\":216.735,\"text\":\"It never opens a single door.\"},{\"start\":217.775,\"end\":220.015,\"text\":\"I was turning down the faucet\"},{\"start\":219.97,\"end\":223.89,\"text\":\"for thousands of women while the drain stayed clogged.\"},{\"start\":224.13,\"end\":227.17,\"text\":\"Then what opens them? That's what he showed me.\"},{\"start\":227.97,\"end\":229.73001,\"text\":\"True sealant cinnamon.\"},{\"start\":230.77,\"end\":231.33,\"text\":\"Cinnamon.\"},{\"start\":232.41501,\"end\":233.695,\"text\":\"I laughed, too.\"},{\"start\":234.895,\"end\":236.73502,\"text\":\"Then he showed me the research.\"},{\"start\":237.695,\"end\":240.815,\"text\":\"Published in the American Diabetes Association's\"},{\"start\":240.815,\"end\":244.09502,\"text\":\"own journal, a compound called MHCP\"},{\"start\":244.255,\"end\":250.23001,\"text\":\"signals those stuck doors to respond to insulin again. The trapped sugar finally moves into the cells.\"},{\"start\":250.63,\"end\":252.07,\"text\":\"A second compound,\"},{\"start\":252.47,\"end\":254.31001,\"text\":\"cinnamaldehyne,\"},{\"start\":255.59,\"end\":257.19,\"text\":\"repairs the vessel lining.\"},{\"start\":257.91,\"end\":259.43,\"text\":\"The sugar has been grinding through.\"},{\"start\":259.995,\"end\":261.99503,\"text\":\"I've tried cinnamon pills.\"},{\"star