{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016BC5XojvtaBq8eiYkdpLMk","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"92cbec28-40c8-4729-bf29-51cfa7e97634\",\"scope\":\"collation\",\"adId\":\"facebook_1058308457008379\",\"collationId\":\"877596041951614\",\"representativeAdId\":\"facebook_1058308457008379\",\"memberAdIds\":[\"facebook_1058308457008379\",\"facebook_1655868292773717\",\"facebook_2704862869986542\",\"facebook_1124617676655382\",\"facebook_2716423012093659\",\"facebook_1131312269394103\",\"facebook_1611470950622265\",\"facebook_1338079859387279\",\"facebook_1409789038023377\",\"facebook_1637401284438093\",\"facebook_1097147546149584\",\"facebook_4106861912781350\",\"facebook_2232439500937448\",\"facebook_1431920135562851\",\"facebook_4560924004140478\",\"facebook_1571595371676777\",\"facebook_1412953417473971\",\"facebook_2534702430370908\",\"facebook_1077387438342917\",\"facebook_1075807144998358\"],\"activeAdIds\":[\"facebook_1058308457008379\"],\"memberAdsCount\":23,\"activeAdsCount\":1,\"memberAdIdsTruncated\":true,\"warnings\":[\"Reach history returned no numeric reach points, so trajectory is shown as unknown.\"],\"analysis\":{\"hook\":{\"text\":\"If you have high blood sugar,\",\"source\":\"ad_transcripts_hook\",\"sourceDescription\":\"Existing completed ad transcript hook.\",\"isFallback\":false},\"hookPattern\":\"unclassified\",\"hookPatternReason\":\"Hook text did not match a known opening pattern.\",\"trajectory\":\"unknown\",\"verdict\":\"History is inconclusive. Monitor the next few days before treating this as a scaler.\"},\"data\":{\"id\":\"facebook_1390947879097942\",\"collationId\":\"877596041951614\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-03T09:33:47.464Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-02T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-08T09:02:30.535Z\",\"daysRunning\":86,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/0747da8321183684cd086eecc534508e851417e1373fdd0414fb2bc3e5155dcf.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/2baea7ee7ca3094df18b6f29627cf7c7e4a1b1080b7bde6df67262fbc9b12621.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"958558520684789\",\"name\":\"John Tucker\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/958558520684789.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"958558520684789\",\"liveAdsCount\":1333,\"reach30d\":492752,\"totalReach\":1373110,\"countriesCount\":5,\"facebookLikes\":4388,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"What happens when you take Metabolae every single day for 90 days? You pop the softgel and the liquid goes straight to your cells.\\nWithin hours, your cell’s mechanism that turns sugar into energy, which are called GLUT4 transporters, start waking up.\\nOn day 7, you wake up energized in the morning because you slept through the night. \\nSince you have less sugar roaming around in your bloodstream, you don’t feel the need to pee at midnight.\\nNo midnight bathroom trips and no soaked sheets from night sweats.\\nWithin two weeks, you might be surprised at your fasting glucose levels.\\nPeople who have been stuck in the 140’s for months see a big reduction. Up to 29% less fasting blood sugar. \\nYou might test again to make sure the meter isn't broken.\\nFirst month.\\nThe nerve pain in your legs and feet is reduced.\\nMost people report having less of it. It’s reduced enough to keep wearing socks and covering your feet with bed sheets.\\nThat’s because blood sugar isn’t making the nerve pain worse.\\nDay 45.\\nYou look in the toilet and see your pee isn’t foamy. \\nThe protein spillage is dropping because your kidneys aren’t overwhelmed clearing all that blood sugar.\\nThey are catching their breath.\\nBy this point, many people see improved creatinine and GFR markers.\\nDay 60.\\nSymptoms from high blood sugar and kidney issues are almost gone.\\nYou no longer feel foggy throughout the day and you can focus better. \\nYour energy remains stable, without relying on caffeine.\\nThat’s because glucose is finally getting INTO your cells... instead of just circulating in your blood.\\nDay 75.\\nYou go back for labs.\\nYou see a couple points higher in your GFR score. \\nYour doctor stares at the screen, pulls up your old results, and gives you a puzzled look, asking what changed.\\n\\\"What changed?\\\"\\nNinety days in.\\nYou walk into your nephrologist's office.\\nThey pull up your labs.\\nGFR is better by 10 points.\\nProtein spillage is down up to 40%.\\nAnd creatinine levels dropped by up to 0.7 points.\\nThe doctor leans back in their chair.\\n\\\"We were preparing to have the dialysis conversation.\\\"\\n\\\"We're not having it today.\\\"\\n\\\"Your kidney function is improving.\\\"\\nJust one softgel a day for 90 days.\\nYour numbers moved in the direction they haven't moved in years.\\nThis is what happens when you take Metabolae Ceylon cinnamon extract, dosed at 7,200mg, for just 90 days…\\nAnd you allow your cells to pull glucose OUT of your blood and INTO your cells.\\nEach pack comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee.\\nThey’re 70% OFF now by clicking the link below.\",\"transcript\":\"If you have high blood sugar, watch what happens when you take metabolite for 90 days. Day one, you pop the soft gel and the liquid goes straight to your cells. Within hours, your cell's mechanism that turns sugar into energy, which are called GLUT4 transporters, start waking up. On day seven, you wake up energized in the morning because you slept through the night. Since you have less sugar roaming around in your bloodstream, you don't feel the need to pee at midnight, no midnight bathroom trips, and no soaked sheets from night sweats. Within two weeks, you might be surprised at your fasting glucose levels. People who have been stuck in the 140s for months see a big reduction, up to 29% less fasting blood sugar. You might test again to make sure the meter isn't broken. First month, the nerve pain in your legs and feet is reduced. Most people report having less of it. It's reduced enough to keep wearing socks and covering your feet with bed sheets. That's because blood sugar isn't making the nerve pain worse. Day 45, you look in the toilet and see your pee isn't foamy. The protein spillage is dropping because your kidneys aren't overwhelmed clearing all that blood sugar. They are catching their breath. By this point, many people see improved creatinine and GFR markers. Day 60, symptoms from high blood sugar and kidney issues are almost gone. You no longer feel foggy throughout the day, and you can focus better. Your energy remains stable without relying on caffeine. That's because glucose is finally getting into your cells instead of just circulating in your blood. Day 75, you go back for labs. You see a couple points higher in your GFR score. Your doctor stares at the screen, pulls up your old results, and gives you a puzzled look, asking what changed. What changed? 90 days in, you walk into your nephrologist's office. They pull up your labs. GFR is better by 10 points. Protein spillage is down up to 40%, and creatinine levels dropped by up to 0.7 points. The doctor leans back in their chair. We were preparing to have the dialysis conversation. We're not having it today. Your kidney function is improving. Just one soft gel a day for 90 days. Your numbers moved in the direction they haven't moved in years. This is what happens when you take Metabolize Salon Cinnamon Extract, dosed at 7,200 milligrams for just 90 days. And you allow your cells to pull glucose out of your blood and into your cells. Each pack comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee. They're 70% off now by clicking the link below.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://metabolae.com/products/softgels-ceylon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"metabolae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":203100,\"aggregatedReach\":203100,\"estimatedSpend\":1828,\"duplicates\":23,\"reachDelta1d\":658,\"reachDelta7d\":3507,\"reachDelta30d\":28676},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":19,\"currentRank\":19,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":1.43},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false},\"transcript\":{\"language\":\"en\",\"languageConfidence\":1,\"segments\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":1.56,\"text\":\"If you have high blood sugar,\"},{\"start\":1.56,\"end\":4.78,\"text\":\"watch what happens when you take metabolite for 90 days.\"},{\"start\":4.78,\"end\":6.78,\"text\":\"Day one, you pop the soft gel\"},{\"start\":6.78,\"end\":8.78,\"text\":\"and the liquid goes straight to your cells.\"},{\"start\":8.78,\"end\":11.120000000000001,\"text\":\"Within hours, your cell's mechanism\"},{\"start\":11.120000000000001,\"end\":12.88,\"text\":\"that turns sugar into energy,\"},{\"start\":12.88,\"end\":16.240000000000002,\"text\":\"which are called GLUT4 transporters, start waking up.\"},{\"start\":16.240000000000002,\"end\":19.26,\"text\":\"On day seven, you wake up energized in the morning\"},{\"start\":19.26,\"end\":20.66,\"text\":\"because you slept through the night.\"},{\"start\":20.66,\"end\":22.66,\"text\":\"Since you have less sugar roaming around\"},{\"start\":22.66,\"end\":24.48,\"text\":\"in your bloodstream, you don't feel the need\"},{\"start\":24.48,\"end\":27.26,\"text\":\"to pee at midnight, no midnight bathroom trips,\"},{\"start\":27.26,\"end\":29.62,\"text\":\"and no soaked sheets from night sweats.\"},{\"start\":29.62,\"end\":31.94,\"text\":\"Within two weeks, you might be surprised\"},{\"start\":31.94,\"end\":33.68,\"text\":\"at your fasting glucose levels.\"},{\"start\":33.68,\"end\":37.06,\"text\":\"People who have been stuck in the 140s for months\"},{\"start\":37.06,\"end\":41.56,\"text\":\"see a big reduction, up to 29% less fasting blood sugar.\"},{\"start\":41.56,\"end\":42.620000000000005,\"text\":\"You might test again\"},{\"start\":42.620000000000005,\"end\":44.3,\"text\":\"to make sure the meter isn't broken.\"},{\"start\":44.3,\"end\":47.88,\"text\":\"First month, the nerve pain in your legs and feet is reduced.\"},{\"start\":47.88,\"end\":49.8,\"text\":\"Most people report having less of it.\"},{\"start\":49.8,\"end\":52.18,\"text\":\"It's reduced enough to keep wearing socks\"},{\"start\":52.18,\"end\":54.22,\"text\":\"and covering your feet with bed sheets.\"},{\"start\":54.22,\"end\":55.58,\"text\":\"That's because blood sugar\"},{\"start\":55.58,\"end\":57.56,\"text\":\"isn't making the nerve pain worse.\"},{\"start\":57.56,\"end\":61.38,\"text\":\"Day 45, you look in the toilet and see your pee isn't foamy.\"},{\"start\":61.38,\"end\":64.14,\"text\":\"The protein spillage is dropping because your kidneys\"},{\"start\":64.14,\"end\":66.68,\"text\":\"aren't overwhelmed clearing all that blood sugar.\"},{\"start\":66.68,\"end\":67.96000000000001,\"text\":\"They are catching their breath.\"},{\"start\":67.96000000000001,\"end\":71,\"text\":\"By this point, many people see improved creatinine\"},{\"start\":71,\"end\":72.38,\"text\":\"and GFR markers.\"},{\"start\":72.38,\"end\":75.94,\"text\":\"Day 60, symptoms from high blood sugar and kidney issues\"},{\"start\":75.94,\"end\":77,\"text\":\"are almost gone.\"},{\"start\":77,\"end\":79.4,\"text\":\"You no longer feel foggy throughout the day,\"},{\"start\":79.4,\"end\":80.52000000000001,\"text\":\"and you can focus better.\"},{\"start\":80.52000000000001,\"end\":83.56,\"text\":\"Your energy remains stable without relying on caffeine.\"},{\"start\":83.56,\"end\":86.94,\"text\":\"That's because glucose is finally getting into your cells\"},{\"start\":86.94,\"end\":88.94,\"text\":\"instead of just circulating in your blood.\"},{\"start\":88.94,\"end\":91.36,\"text\":\"Day 75, you go back for labs.\"},{\"start\":91.36,\"end\":94.24000000000001,\"text\":\"You see a couple points higher in your GFR score.\"},{\"start\":94.24000000000001,\"end\":97.52000000000001,\"text\":\"Your doctor stares at the screen, pulls up your old results,\"},{\"start\":97.52000000000001,\"end\":100.38,\"text\":\"and gives you a puzzled look, asking what changed.\"},{\"start\":100.38,\"end\":101.22,\"text\":\"What changed?\"},{\"start\":101.22,\"end\":104.24000000000001,\"text\":\"90 days in, you walk into your nephrologist's office.\"},{\"start\":104.24000000000001,\"end\":105.44,\"text\":\"They pull up your labs.\"},{\"start\":105.44,\"end\":107.82,\"text\":\"GFR is better by 10 points.\"},{\"start\":107.82,\"end\":110.58,\"text\":\"Protein spillage is down up to 40%,\"},{\"start\":110.58,\"end\":114.58,\"text\":\"and creatinine levels dropped by up to 0.7 points.\"},{\"start\":114.58,\"end\":116.56,\"text\":\"The doctor leans back in their chair.\"},{\"start\":116.56,\"end\":119.32,\"text\":\"We were preparing to have the dialysis conversation.\"},{\"start\":119.32,\"end\":120.6,\"text\":\"We're not having it today.\"},{\"start\":120.6,\"end\":122.38,\"text\":\"Your kidney function is improving.\"},{\"start\":122.38,\"end\":125.2,\"text\":\"Just one soft gel a day for 90 days.\"},{\"start\":125.2,\"end\":126.94,\"text\":\"Your numbers moved in the direction\"},{\"start\":126.94,\"end\":128.62,\"text\":\"they haven't moved in years.\"},{\"start\":128.62,\"end\":130.1,\"text\":\"This is what happens when you take\"},{\"start\":130.1,\"end\":132.7,\"text\":\"Metabolize Salon Cinnamon Extract,\"},{\"start\":132.7,\"end\":136.92,\"text\":\"dosed at 7,200 milligrams for just 90 days.\"},{\"start\":136.92,\"end\":139.45999999999998,\"text\":\"And you allow your cells to pull glucose\"},{\"start\":139.45999999999998,\"end\":141.76,\"text\":\"out of your blood and into your cells.\"},{\"start\":141.76,\"end\":144.92,\"text\":\"Each pack comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee.\"},{\"start\":144.92,\"end\":148.22,\"text\":\"They're 70% off now by clicking the link below.\"}],\"fullText\":\"If you have high blood sugar, watch what happens when you take metabolite for 90 days. Day one, you pop the soft gel and the liquid goes straight to your cells. Within hours, your cell's mechanism that turns sugar into energy, which are called GLUT4 transporters, start waking up. On day seven, you wake up energized in the morning because you slept through the night. Since you have less sugar roaming around in your bloodstream, you don't feel the need to pee at midnight, no midnight bathroom trips, and no soaked sheets from night sweats. Within two weeks, you might be surprised at your fasting glucose levels. People who have been stuck in the 140s for months see a big reduction, up to 29% less fasting blood sugar. You might test again to make sure the meter isn't broken. First month, the nerve pain in your legs and feet is reduced. Most people report having less of it. It's reduced enough to keep wearing socks and covering your feet with bed sheets. That's because blood sugar isn't making the nerve pain worse. Day 45, you look in the toilet and see your pee isn't foamy. The protein spillage is dropping because your kidneys aren't overwhelmed clearing all that blood sugar. They are catching their breath. By this point, many people see improved creatinine and GFR markers. Day 60, symptoms from high blood sugar and kidney issues are almost gone. You no longer feel foggy throughout the day, and you can focus better. Your energy remains stable without relying on caffeine. That's because glucose is finally getting into your cells instead of just circulating in your blood. Day 75, you go back for labs. You see a couple points higher in your GFR score. Your doctor stares at the screen, pulls up your old results, and gives you a puzzled look, asking what changed. What changed? 90 days in, you walk into your nephrologist's office. They pull up your labs. GFR is better by 10 points. Protein spillage is down up to 40%, and creatinine levels dropped by up to 0.7 points. The doctor leans back in their chair. We were preparing to have the dialysis conversation. We're not having it today. Your kidney function is improving. Just one soft gel a day for 90 days. Your numbers moved in the direction they haven't moved in years. This is what happens when you take Metabolize Salon Cinnamon Extract, dosed at 7,200 milligrams for just 90 days. And you allow your cells to pull glucose out of your blood and into your cells. Each pack comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee. They're 70% off now by clicking the link below.\"},\"creativeAnalysis\":{\"hook\":{\"text\":\"If you have high blood sugar,\",\"source\":\"ad_transcripts_hook\",\"sourceDescription\":\"Existing completed ad transcript hook.\",\"isFallback\":false}},\"links\":{\"adLibraryUrl\":\"https://www.facebook.com/ads/library/?view_all_page_id=958558520684789&id=1390947879097942\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://metabolae.com/products/softgels-ceylon\"},\"shops\":[{\"shopId\":\"2eefa756-07ac-4464-904f-7e73af9d8838\",\"domain\":\"metabolae.com\",\"name\":\"Metabolae\",\"isPrimary\":true,\"traffic\":3005286,\"categories\":null},{\"shopId\":\"e93d1229-b4e5-400b-9a81-011aafcf7c16\",\"domain\":\"facebook.com\",\"name\":\"facebook.com\",\"isPrimary\":false,\"traffic\":11263494640,\"categories\":null}],\"pageAnalytics\":{\"impressionsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-03-19\",\"totalImpressions\":5},{\"date\":\"2026-03-20\",\"totalImpressions\":7},{\"date\":\"2026-03-21\",\"totalImpressions\":16},{\"date\":\"2026-03-22\",\"totalImpressions\":2},{\"date\":\"2026-03-23\",\"totalImpressions\":0},{\"date\":\"2026-03-24\",\"totalImpressions\":0},{\"date\":\"2026-03-25\",\"totalImpressions\":0},{\"date\":\"2026-03-26\",\"totalImpressions\":64},{\"date\":\"2026-03-27\",\"totalImpressions\":43},{\"date\":\"2026-03-28\",\"totalImpressions\":144},{\"date\":\"2026-03-29\",\"totalImpressions\":293